('00469268-25c0-406e-89a2-17f815010821', 'Wooden Ships-Slab', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_6811ab792d46c.webp\",\"Merchandise_6811ab792e3e9.webp\",\"Merchandise_6811ab792e678.webp\"]', '{\"Size\":\"Customizable\",\"Design\":\"Customizable\"}', 'Give a vintage style to every drink you serve. We help you give a sweet impression to your table and other flat surface, while protecting it from direct spills.', 351, '2025-04-14 21:59:05', '2026-04-28 06:12:48', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', '2026-04-27 09:46:37'),
('010c5558-e9f6-4f35-ab3e-f27e79ab30a5', 'Phone Holder', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_6811a8f28da09.webp\",\"Merchandise_6811a8f28e7f4.webp\",\"Merchandise_6811a8f28efef.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"High-quality stainless steel\",\"Design\":\"Elegant, sleek design\",\"Ink Type\":\"Smooth-flowing ballpoint \\/ gel ink\",\"Customization\":\"Option for laser engraving of names, logos, or messages\"}', 'A practical and versatile custom phone holder designed to keep your device secure and within easy reach at your desk, in your car, or at home. It offers sturdy support for various phone sizes, making it perfect for video calls, watching videos, or navigation. What sets it apart is the option to personalize it with your logo, name, or unique design, making it ideal for personal use, corporate gifts, or promotional events while combining everyday functionality with a customized touch.', 390, '2025-04-15 02:02:27', '2026-05-12 12:54:14', 0, 'Aktif', '2026-04-27 09:46:49'),
('018ff508-547b-447b-8b1d-8a79dc4ca5a5', 'No Smoking Sign', 9, 4, 0, 0, '[\"Acrylic_6811a43e1c98a.webp\",\"Acrylic_6811a43e1cf31.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Custom\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'A clear and professional safety sign designed to indicate non-smoking areas. Made from durable materials suitable for indoor or outdoor use, it ensures visibility and compliance with workplace and public safety regulations.', 425, '2025-04-14 21:39:51', '2026-05-10 18:19:35', 0, 'Aktif', '2026-04-24 08:47:58'),
('0216bb04-816c-45eb-a695-ab42d6908a64', 'Detecting Tumbler Red', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_6811c368e973e.webp\",\"Tumbler_6811c368eed25.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless\",\"Size\":\"500ml\"}', 'A sleek and durable stainless-steel tumbler designed for everyday use. With a 500 ml capacity, it’s perfect for keeping your favorite hot or cold drinks within reach at work, during commutes, or while traveling. Built to maintain temperature and withstand daily wear, it offers reliable performance wherever you go. The clean, vibrant red finish adds a bold, stylish touch, making it both a practical and eye-catching accessory.', 324, '2025-04-12 01:18:51', '2026-05-01 12:40:37', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('0317c1aa-0c49-4a58-8cde-2aaee8d212cb', 'Sport Tumbler Black', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_685a74962e407.webp\",\"Tumbler_685a749631f01.webp\",\"Tumbler_685a749632a46.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless Steel\",\"Design\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"500ml\"}', 'Suitable for use as community merchandise, campus event gifts, or stylish daily equipment. Equipped with a carabiner hanger, this tumbler is easy to hang on a bag, backpack, or carry during outdoor activities.', 383, '2025-06-24 02:49:10', '2026-05-06 20:17:24', 4, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('036ece36-a8b6-4168-9297-a0b1bed98d31', 'Red Travel Tumbler', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_68e0cfea6d1ab.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless Steel\",\"Text\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"350ml\"}', 'This tumbler is crafted using a high-quality engraving machine or advanced UV laser printing technology to ensure precise, sharp, and long-lasting designs. The professional printing process creates a clean and durable finish that resists fading and everyday wear. With premium production quality offered at an affordable price, it is an excellent choice for custom gifts, corporate branding, and promotional merchandise.', 125, '2025-10-04 00:42:34', '2026-05-11 23:48:36', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('03a9064b-f608-49da-a059-a40ec161dd5e', 'Pesta Otomotif', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_681ad0287ba8c.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Thickness\":\"8mm\"}', 'This elegant clear acrylic plaque is made from acrylic material. With neat and detailed laser engraving, the writing and logo of the automotive event \'Pesta Otomotif SUMUT 2016\' are clearly displayed.', 259, '2025-05-06 20:14:48', '2026-05-02 16:51:11', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('03dc4e16-860b-4aa3-9762-fb66911c9d5e', 'Banner', 8, 3, 0, 0, '[\"Digital Printing_6811a8915ef09.webp\",\"Digital Printing_6811a8915fe99.webp\"]', '{\"Size\":\"Custom\",\"Color\":\"Custom\",\"Material\":\"Flexi\\/ Vinyl\"}', 'A customizable printed banner designed for promotional campaigns, events, and outdoor advertising. Made with durable materials to ensure visibility and resistance in various conditions.', 433, '2025-04-14 02:29:27', '2026-05-01 23:47:20', 0, 'Aktif', '2026-04-27 02:05:24'),
('055d95ee-9600-4084-bf38-01bd9f3300b3', 'Plaque of Edutax Award', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_6a02dfed00687.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Red, White\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'Celebrate the intersection of civic duty and academic achievement with a plaque that is as vibrant as it is meaningful. This custom acrylic plaque is designed to honor educational institutions and individuals who lead the way in social and tax-awareness initiatives.', 0, '2026-05-12 08:08:13', '2026-05-12 08:08:13', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('05814013-5af4-4d19-9336-9978039e82a9', 'Sport  Tumbler', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_6811bf886640c.webp\",\"Tumbler_6811bf8867281.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless\",\"Size\":\"500ml\"}', 'A versatile tumbler designed for active lifestyles. Featuring a secure lid and durable body, it is suitable for sports activities, travel, and daily hydration.', 373, '2025-04-28 19:11:39', '2026-04-13 22:13:28', 1, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('05c62aff-1b84-4750-975f-6ff3547e249b', 'PDGI Social Service Activities', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_693b8ef084793.png\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Tooth_Shaped Design\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18cm\"}', 'This exclusive, tooth-shaped award plaque is made of clear crystal, specially designed for appreciation events, community service, and healthcare or educational institutions. It comes in a premium velvet box for an elegant appearance and safe transportation and storage.', 171, '2025-12-11 20:41:36', '2026-05-12 16:54:07', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('05fd4f0a-5a35-492d-9de7-da3666aaf6d8', 'Coffee Tumbler', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_6811c0e34ded9.webp\",\"Tumbler_6811c0e34ec20.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless\",\"Size\":\"350ml\",\"Color\":\"Custom\"}', 'Look stylish and eco-friendly with premium custom tumblers. Made from high-quality materials with an elegant design that can be customized with your name, logo or personal message.', 359, '2025-04-15 01:21:50', '2026-04-13 08:51:55', 1, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('06231ab7-bb11-4326-8ae5-56975974c451', 'Plaque/Plakat Fei Die Tires', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_6871de5d827e7.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_6871de5d94768.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_6871de5d953f5.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Desain\":\"Custom\"}', 'This elegantly designed round acrylic plaque was specially created as a symbol of appreciation and gratitude to the North Sumatra Chamber of Commerce and Industry (KADIN). Made of high-quality clear acrylic, the full-color print combines blue and purple gradients, creating a modern and luxurious look. The edge of the plaque is designed to resemble a motorcycle tire pattern, emphasizing the event\'s automotive-related theme. The award lettering is neatly printed in a combination of gold and white, highlighting event details such as product introductions, partnership offers, and discussions on motorcycle tire market needs in Indonesia. The plaque is presented in a blue velvet box with satin lining and a gold clasp for a premium feel. It is suitable as an official souvenir for business events, product exhibitions, or corporate collaborations.', 420, '2025-07-11 21:02:37', '2026-05-08 09:22:11', 9, 'Aktif', '2026-04-27 07:08:21'),
('07891d55-b85e-4185-b9b9-b0d16581e21e', 'Event Desk BSN', 8, 13, 0, 0, '[\"Portofolio of Digital Printing_69e8445dc683f.jpeg\",\"Portofolio of Digital Printing_69e8445dcc651.jpeg\"]', '{\"Size\":\"39 x 81 x 80 cm\",\"Material\":\"PVC\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'A set of promotional counters with a green design and clear branding. The setup looks neat and professional, making it suitable for events, booths, or product promotions.', 4, '2026-04-22 03:45:33', '2026-04-29 04:13:50', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('084f31a6-3e12-40fa-8b0a-7c3b03618e9d', 'Sticker BNCT', 8, 13, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_69d9e815d49b0.jpg\",\"Merchandise_69d9e815d6016.jpg\"]', '{\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'High-quality sticker made with durable, waterproof material and vibrant colors that last. Perfect for decorating laptops, tumblers, notebooks, or any smooth surface. Easy to apply and remove without leaving residue', 6, '2026-04-11 06:20:05', '2026-05-08 02:40:28', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('08f4715a-1fba-43fd-9e23-2cd24172f8ae', 'PTPN 2 x STIPAP Medan', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df54fa1b39d.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df54fa29595.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Rectangular Design\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18cm\"}', '\"This commemorative acrylic plaque was presented by PTPN 2 to STIPAP Medan students as a token of appreciation for completing their internship program. With a modern transparent design, elegant golden accents, and detailed inscriptions, it symbolizes knowledge, growth, and professional collaboration. Packaged in a premium velvet box, this plaque is a meaningful keepsake for academic and corporate partnerships.\"', 92, '2025-10-02 21:45:46', '2026-04-05 13:00:46', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('0910a781-a496-4162-a362-47a360ebb341', 'Keychains', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_6811c14883190.webp\",\"Merchandise_6811c148845a6.webp\",\"Merchandise_6811c187b815e.webp\"]', '{\"Size\":\"Custom\",\"Thickness\":\"Custom\"}', 'Customizable accessories available in various shapes and thicknesses, perfect for personal use or as a gift.', 316, '2025-04-14 20:15:34', '2026-05-06 20:29:06', 1, 'Tidak Aktif', '2026-04-27 09:48:16'),
('096a6e4e-2ca1-45e3-964a-a29597010fb7', 'Plaque Futsal Turnamen', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_6a019f729cf06.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_6a019f72e792c.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_6a02db1003ed7.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_6a02db101a035.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Gold. Silver, Bronze\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'Capture the energy of the match with a plaque that puts the athlete at the center. This bespoke acrylic plaque features a precision-cut silhouette of a football player in action, making it a standout choice for high-energy tournaments and sports leagues.', 3, '2026-05-11 09:20:51', '2026-05-12 07:47:48', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('0ac202c0-3e6d-4dab-bc81-d2cd5e2debcd', 'graduate Program (S2)', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df7454d6d2f.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df74550b8c5.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Teardrop-Shaped Design\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18cm\"}', 'This set of three matching, elegant acrylic plaques features a distinctive teardrop or flame-like shape, symbolizing dynamic growth and achievement. The plaques are designed for the Postgraduate Program (S2) of Medan Tourism Polytechnic (Politeknik Pariwisata Medan), specifically for the Applied Master\'s Program in Tourism Planning and Development. The design incorporates the institution\'s logo and primary colors (blue and yellow) onto the clear acrylic body. Mounted on sturdy acrylic bases, these items likely serve as graduation awards, appreciation tokens, or commemorative souvenirs for students, staff, or partners of the Master\'s program.', 212, '2025-10-02 23:59:33', '2026-04-20 07:13:25', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('0bfc6c4f-e432-4627-b351-c8ac8acf3ba0', 'Flashdisk card', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_6811aa4e0d3b2.webp\",\"Merchandise_6811aa4e0da9f.webp\"]', '{\"Types\":\"6 GB or 8GB\",\"Form Factor\":\"8.5 cm x 5.5 cm\",\"Color Options\":\"Customizable\"}', 'Store your important data in style with premium custom flash drives. Made from high-quality materials, available in a variety of elegant models, and can be personalized according to your identity or company.', 337, '2025-04-15 00:29:45', '2026-05-10 05:52:17', 0, 'Aktif', '2026-04-28 06:51:10'),
('0ce4e8c1-4da4-4a38-ab1e-e0a73070abf1', 'Telkom Property GSD Area 1', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df72a36aa28.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df72a36fb6f.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18cm\"}', 'This modern and striking acrylic plaque serves as a corporate award or recognition piece. The design features a bold, multi-layered look with a prominent red and white graphic and the TelkomProperty logo. It recognizes the achievement or status of \"GSD AREA 1 SUMATERA\" (General Support Division Area 1 Sumatra). Encased in a sturdy, clear acrylic body and mounted on a black base, this plaque signifies corporate excellence. It is presented professionally within a luxurious green velvet box, ensuring a high-end and exclusive presentation suitable for internal corporate awards.', 229, '2025-10-02 23:52:19', '2026-05-08 20:34:46', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('0eb4420b-cb01-41c9-8bfe-c998fcce5868', 'KKN Appreciation', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df82c2dd9de.jpg\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df82c2de0cd.jpg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Curved Design\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18cm\"}', 'This unique, custom-shaped acrylic plaque serves as a formal token of Gratitude and Thanks. It is presented by the Student Community Service (KKN) team from Universitas Negeri Medan (UNIMED) to the local village heads and staff (specifically mentioning Desa Banjaran, Sirandorung, Tapanuli Tengah, and Bapak Rusman Marbun, S.Pd). The design is visually rich, featuring an innovative curved silhouette and a striking Batak Ulos traditional pattern overlay, incorporating the UNIMED logo. This premium keepsake is beautifully displayed within a luxurious red velvet box, ensuring an exclusive and memorable presentation suitable for commemorating cultural and educational partnerships.', 148, '2025-10-03 01:01:06', '2026-05-12 07:06:35', 1, 'Tidak Aktif', '2026-04-27 02:27:52'),
('0f2be030-1fa1-41aa-a09a-64547c27aa19', 'Room Name', 9, 4, 0, 0, '[\"Acrylic_6811abecc7198.webp\",\"Acrylic_6811abecc7689.webp\"]', '{\"Size\":\"Custom\",\"Text\":\"Custom\"}', 'Made from acrylic with various color options available. The shape and text can be customized to meet your need.', 305, '2025-04-14 20:23:44', '2026-05-09 03:01:13', 2, 'Aktif', '2026-04-24 08:48:20'),
('0f53919d-cacc-484f-bc56-cc32f46574dc', 'Bawaslu Branded Pens', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_68b80b40ed866.webp\",\"Merchandise_68b80b40edefa.webp\",\"Merchandise_68b80b40ee096.webp\"]', '{\"Type pen\":\"Retractable ballpoint pen\",\"Colors ink\":\"Green, Blue, and Orange\",\"Material\":\"Plastic\"}', 'The product, named Bawaslu Branded Pens, is a set of four promotional click pens. Each pen features the official Bawaslu logo and comes in a distinct color: orange, red, blue, and green. These pens are perfect for use in official events, public campaigns, and as promotional giveaways to raise awareness for the organization\'s mission.', 357, '2025-09-03 02:32:48', '2026-05-12 03:43:20', 1, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('0fc18e79-426e-4ae7-a165-3565a2fcc1cd', 'Pushbutton Tumbler', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_6811c2b58fb66.webp\",\"Tumbler_6811c2b5902a7.webp\"]', '{\"Size\":\"320ml\",\"Color\":\"White\"}', 'Equipped with a one-touch push-button lid for effortless drinking. The secure locking mechanism prevents spills, making it perfect for commuting, office use, or long trips.', 436, '2025-04-12 01:34:01', '2026-05-10 04:05:54', 3, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('11437454-d90e-4c9b-bdac-2f13cef63686', 'Powerbank', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_6811a9680cf0b.webp\",\"Merchandise_6811a9680d5cb.webp\"]', '{\"Capacity\":\"20,000 mAh\",\"Input\":\"USB-C and Micro USB\",\"Weight\":\"400 grams\",\"Material\":\"Aluminum casing with premium finish\",\"LED Indicators\":\"Battery level display\",\"Color Options\":\"Black, Silver, Gold\"}', 'Stand out with an exclusive custom power bank. Comes with elegant design, quality materials, and fast charging feature. A great choice for premium gifts and professional branding.', 295, '2025-04-15 00:43:45', '2026-05-01 23:47:35', 0, 'Aktif', '2026-04-27 09:49:33'),
('1199db0f-99ff-4170-835c-196e8d145952', 'Mosque Construction Donors', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df79bc92d2b.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df79bc93434.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18cm\"}', 'This unique and deeply meaningful acrylic plaque serves as a formal token of Gratitude and Thanks for a religious contribution. It is presented by the Masjid Al-Jamil Development Committee to the donors who contributed to the construction of the mosque. The design features an artistic, full-color 3D-like depiction of the Al-Jamil Mosque embedded within the clear acrylic, framed by a distinctive yellow and red curved border. The text expresses thanks, includes a calligraphy of Basmalah, and the prayer \"Jazakumullah Khairan Katsiran\". This beautiful keepsake is presented within a luxurious red velvet box, ensuring a respectful, exclusive, and professional presentation suitable for religious acknowledgement.', 86, '2025-10-03 00:22:36', '2026-04-27 07:04:28', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', '2026-04-27 02:26:17'),
('11c2585b-be3a-4be1-aaf3-80b1bc19af3e', 'Content Creator Competition', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df7f0822075.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df7f0824a7d.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Distinctive Pentagonal Design\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18cm\"}', 'This modern, pentagon-shaped acrylic plaque serves as a prestigious Championship Award or trophy. It is presented for the Content Creator Competition organized by PT. Al’Muchtar Tour & Travel and their Bus Lounge Safari Al’Muchtar for the 2020-2021 period. The design is sleek, featuring a bold, angular corporate logo that is sharply etched or printed onto the clear acrylic. The overall clean aesthetic perfectly suits a creative competition. This premium trophy is elegantly packaged within a luxurious dark green velvet box, ensuring an exclusive and memorable presentation suitable for corporate recognition and competition winners.', 132, '2025-10-03 00:45:12', '2026-05-01 23:47:48', 0, 'Aktif', '2026-04-27 07:16:59'),
('123d4607-08a0-4f2c-b4a0-796172d81505', 'Walker Thermos White', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_6811c31160277.webp\",\"Tumbler_6811c31162615.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless\",\"Size\":\"500ml\"}', 'A premium insulated thermos designed to maintain beverage temperature for extended periods. Featuring a clean white finish and ergonomic design, it is ideal for professional settings, travel, and corporate gifting.', 278, '2025-04-12 01:22:28', '2026-04-15 02:26:25', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('127fef1d-5b47-4545-aaee-3929d48ee05c', 'Enduro Racing Plaque', 2, 2, 0, 0, '[\"Design Concept_69ddb3cd32f0e.jpg\",\"Design Concept_69ddb3cd3a5e4.jpg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\"}', 'Premium custom award plaque featuring a unique miniature oil bottle design, elegantly mounted on a clear acrylic base. Comes with a luxurious red velvet presentation box, making it perfect for corporate recognition, automotive events, or special appreciation ceremonies. Durable, eye-catching, and fully customizable to suit your branding needs.', 15, '2026-04-14 03:26:05', '2026-05-11 08:10:01', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('12b792f2-8d7a-48de-83ed-99fa7a10e776', 'Plakat PLN', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68e08679a0e70.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68e08679b0246.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Colour\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Flame-Shaped Design\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18 cm\"}', 'This crystal award plaque features an elegant flame shape, symbolizing energy and achievement. With custom full-color logo printing and precision laser engraving, it is ideal for corporate events, sports competitions, and special commemorations. The plaque is presented in a premium blue velvet gift box, making it a prestigious award for any occasion.', 176, '2025-10-03 19:29:13', '2026-04-29 07:35:21', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('13c3b067-c2a0-4adf-bd9d-f1c21635117b', 'House Number Acrylic', 8, 13, 0, 0, '[\"Portofolio of Digital Printing_69da10602db54.jpeg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Black & White\"}', 'Give your house number an elegant and luxurious look with our custom designs', 3, '2026-04-11 09:12:00', '2026-05-10 02:35:34', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
