('13fefdd7-566d-41e3-82f9-14de6bf654a2', 'Matte Black BT Tumbler', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_68e0cddcecb87.webp\",\"Tumbler_68e0cddced998.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless Steel\",\"Size\":\"750ml\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'This tumbler is processed with a high-quality engraving machine or advanced UV laser printing technology, delivering sharp, precise, and durable designs. The professional finishing ensures a clean and long-lasting result that resists fading and daily use. Combining premium craftsmanship with an affordable price, it offers excellent value for personalized gifts, corporate branding, and promotional products.', 158, '2025-10-04 00:33:48', '2026-05-05 18:59:40', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
