('165f67bf-ef7c-4a25-ab6b-6f96ecb79672', 'Acrylic Custom of KADIN', 9, 12, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Acrylic_682ef186ce332.webp\",\"Portfolio of Acrylic_682ef186d57a6.webp\"]', '{\"Dimensions\":\"Customizable\",\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Finish\":\"Glossy\\/Matte\"}', 'Showcase your pride in North Sumatra with this beautifully crafted emblem display plaque. Featuring the official coat of arms of the North Sumatra province, the design includes symbolic elements such as golden horses, a traditional sailing ship, and a central shield representing the rich cultural and natural heritage of the region.  Beneath the emblem, the regional motto “Tabah, Jujur, Setia” – meaning “Resilient, Honest, Loyal” – is proudly displayed on a bold blue ribbon, emphasizing the core values of the province.  Perfect for office décor, government institutions, schools, or personal collections, this plaque is printed on a sturdy base with vibrant colors and fine detail. Its elegant design makes it an ideal gift or souvenir representing North Sumatran identity.', 154, '2025-05-22 02:42:31', '2026-04-19 06:04:39', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('167bb476-3cc7-491c-b30f-4c96083daded', 'Niagara Tumbler with Black Button', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_68e0c83711a61.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless Steel\",\"Design\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"500ml\"}', 'This tumbler is crafted using a high-quality engraving machine or advanced UV laser printing technology to ensure sharp, precise, and long-lasting designs. The professional process delivers a clean, durable finish that resists fading and daily wear. Offering premium customization at an affordable price, it is an ideal choice for personalized gifts, company branding, and promotional merchandise.', 209, '2025-10-04 00:09:43', '2026-04-12 22:47:50', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
