('21678180-7bc6-4345-ac6e-539f7a342196', 'Spruce Voucher', 8, 13, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_69d9c5af17b52.jpeg\",\"Merchandise_69d9c5af1e39b.jpeg\"]', '{\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'A voucher is a practical product that can be used as a form of payment or a gift with a specific value. It is suitable for various needs such as shopping, dining, or other services. Vouchers offer convenience, flexibility, and freedom of choice for the recipient—making them an easy yet meaningful gift option.', 4, '2026-04-11 03:53:19', '2026-04-17 11:53:22', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('21def3cd-df0b-4184-919c-f86a28c7ea31', 'Niagara Tumbler with White Button', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_68e0df0158978.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless\",\"Design\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"750ml\"}', 'This tumbler is expertly processed using a high-quality engraving machine or advanced UV laser printing technology, ensuring sharp detailing and a smooth, professional finish. The durable printing method keeps the design clear and resistant to fading, even with regular use. Combining premium production standards with an affordable price, it is an excellent choice for custom gifts, branding, or promotional needs.', 141, '2025-10-04 01:46:57', '2026-04-07 21:38:53', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
