('2a87042f-6474-406d-a70c-0f85a8c82bb7', 'X-Banner Gaterbas', 8, 13, 0, 0, '[\"Portofolio of Digital Printing_6875fa5a358d7.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Korea Matte \\/ Albatros\",\"Size\":\"60 x 160 cm\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'The promotional banner for the GATERBAS Coffee coffee shop features an attractive design with a combination of dark green and white, accented by fresh coffee beans. The main text, \"ALWAYS FRESHLY Coffee For You,\" is printed in bold, modern typography, emphasizing the message of the coffee\'s freshness. The visual section features an image of a contemporary coffee milk drink with ice cubes, looking tempting and refreshing, perfect for attracting customers. The GATERBAS logo is prominently displayed, adding a professional impression and strengthening the brand\'s identity.', 352, '2025-07-14 23:51:06', '2026-04-29 07:57:42', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('2b3097ee-67e3-4eb3-84be-c9acd5c080f5', 'Siti Hajar Medan MUG', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_69df0e9836787.jpg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Ceramic\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'Bring your brand to life with our Full-Print Sublimation Mugs. Utilizing advanced heat-transfer technology, we offer edge-to-edge printing that allows for complex patterns, vibrant gradients, and high-resolution graphics. As seen in our creative collaboration for school events and academic competitions, these mugs turn a simple utility into a colorful piece of art that makes every coffee break more inspiring.', 7, '2026-04-15 04:05:44', '2026-05-04 04:08:29', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('2c03bedd-2140-43a0-8e1c-191eb7cf90f9', 'Plaque/Plakat TEMPLATE 005', 2, 2, 0, 0, '[\"Plaque(Plakat)_6811a4925e21c.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Thickness\":\"8mm & 5mm\",\"Height\":\"13cm x 18 cm\"}', 'This plaque is an elegantly designed and modern form of appreciation, suitable for giving thanks or mementos in various activities or events. Its simple yet attractive design makes it universally usable by various institutions, organizations, or communities.', 277, '2025-04-11 02:39:56', '2026-05-08 02:05:22', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', '2026-04-27 02:22:16'),
('2de51629-8cc8-470a-a780-a30707a7d78d', 'Pelindo Keychain', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_69e0a253f1d29.jpeg\",\"Merchandise_69e0a253f262c.jpeg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'A sleek set of custom acrylic corporate keychains featuring the **Pelindo** logo in a clean rectangular design with sharp full-color printing. Crafted with durable acrylic and sturdy metal rings, these keychains are perfect for company merchandise, staff souvenirs, event giveaways, or client appreciation gifts. Their professional look makes them a practical branding accessory that keeps your company identity visible every day.', 6, '2026-04-16 08:48:19', '2026-05-10 18:23:38', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('2df37f7e-56f4-4895-8a04-f38969894e2c', 'Women Fun Run Trophy', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_693b92e57d00b.png\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Blue and Purple\",\"Design\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18 cm\"}', 'An exclusive trophy for the Fest & Fun Run 3K & 5K, Women\'s 5K General category. Designed with a modern, colorful look, this trophy is perfect for sporting events, especially running competitions. With its dynamic shape and bright colors, this trophy conveys a sporty, energetic, and enthusiastic impression.', 107, '2025-12-11 20:58:29', '2026-05-08 23:55:16', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('2e1cc411-72b6-46fd-a200-aef911bd8ebd', 'Shaped Keychains', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_69e0a0262bb45.jpg\",\"Merchandise_69e0a02633b5c.jpg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Design\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"Custom\"}', 'A cute custom acrylic anime keychain featuring an adorable cheerful character illustration in vibrant full-color print. Made with durable clear acrylic and precision-cut edges, this keychain is perfect for decorating bags, keys, pouches, or backpacks. A fun collectible and thoughtful gift for anime lovers, adding a playful and charming touch to everyday accessories.', 6, '2026-04-16 08:39:02', '2026-05-08 10:37:11', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('2e681aab-61e3-4905-b9c4-97d6122da7b0', 'Plaque/Plakat TEMPLATE 002', 2, 2, 0, 0, '[\"Plaque(Plakat)_6811a60ca3b6e.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Thickness\":\"8mm & 5mm\",\"Height\":\"13cm x 18 cm\"}', 'This plaque is an elegantly designed and modern form of appreciation, suitable for giving thanks or mementos in various activities or events. Its simple yet attractive design makes it universally usable by various institutions, organizations, or communities.', 277, '2025-04-10 20:36:54', '2026-04-27 02:25:37', 1, 'Tidak Aktif', '2026-04-27 02:23:10');
