('308edb4d-3126-4a2b-a014-577a6079768c', 'Spanduk', 8, 3, 0, 0, '[\"Digital Printing_69da16a63f04a.png\"]', '{\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'High-quality custom banner made with durable materials and vibrant printing for maximum visibility. Designed to effectively promote your brand, products, or services, making it ideal for workshops, events, and outdoor advertising', 14, '2026-04-11 06:34:59', '2026-05-09 00:10:24', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('31119f32-5f08-46db-b961-a47cb9698440', 'Lili Coffee Tumbler Black', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_6811c2a8f3a3b.webp\",\"Tumbler_6811c2a9007c4.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless\",\"Size\":\"500ml\\/1700ml\\/2000ml\",\"Color\":\"Custom\"}', 'A sleek and professional coffee tumbler in black, offering modern aesthetics and practical insulation. Perfect for corporate giveaways or daily use.', 328, '2025-04-12 01:24:19', '2026-04-11 16:23:27', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('31173899-dc5e-49cd-820f-4ee5844adb33', 'Event Display Acrylic', 9, 4, 0, 0, '[\"Acrylic_6811a7ea91683.webp\",\"Acrylic_6811a7ea928b9.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'A stand or display device made of acrylic, used to showcase products, information, or promotional materials.', 395, '2025-04-14 20:56:04', '2026-05-01 23:47:01', 0, 'Aktif', '2026-04-24 08:47:39'),
('31a18ffa-e781-4fce-8d1b-9cb1c5d280cd', 'Tali Kasih Goodie Bag', 8, 13, 0, 0, '[\"Portofolio of Digital Printing_69e8508d15fbd.png\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Spunbond\",\"Color\":\"White\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'The professional choice for high-volume event packaging. These spunbound goodie bags combine a lightweight feel with robust durability, offering a cost-effective yet premium branding solution. Available in various professional colors with sharp, long-lasting printing, they ensure your organization’s identity is presented with clarity and care at every touchpoint.', 4, '2026-04-15 03:46:31', '2026-04-22 04:37:33', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('323cebc3-2475-4ef4-876c-1aa28f51fd01', 'Badan Amil Zakat Plaque', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_69dc98d6d10a8.jpeg\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_69dc98e9eca02.jpeg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'Make every recognition moment unforgettable with our custom-shaped floral plaques. Combining crystal-clear acrylic with vibrant UV-printed graphics, this award is designed to be a standout piece on any desk or display. Each plaque is paired with a luxurious velvet-lined box, ensuring a prestigious presentation for your most valued recipients.', 13, '2026-04-13 07:18:12', '2026-05-11 08:10:25', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('334699ad-b905-425b-afbe-8febea877319', 'Bowling Tumbler White', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_6811c1a61361b.webp\",\"Tumbler_6811c1a616ddb.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless\",\"Size\":\"500ml\\/1700ml\\/2000ml\"}', 'A sturdy and spacious transport bag designed for heavy-duty everyday use. Made from durable materials with reinforced handles and a practical zip closure, it offers secure storage and easy portability for equipment, documents, or merchandise. Ideal for events, travel, work sites, or organizational use, this black transport bag combines functionality with a clean, versatile design.', 165, '2025-04-12 01:46:04', '2026-05-03 16:20:58', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('340b896d-1091-4ead-8abd-c1ec9e976b2b', 'Plaque Sport Cular', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_6a0199870240d.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Black\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'Celebrate sporting achievements with trophies that embody the energy of the game. Our custom sports acrylic plaque feature a unique, aerodynamic shape with vibrant, high-definition graphics, combining modern style with substantial quality.', 4, '2026-05-11 08:55:35', '2026-05-11 09:01:45', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('348ef592-51c0-44c8-ac54-db9d02cec1d2', 'Corporate Logo Keychains', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_69e84e4da99fa.png\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'Reinforce your organization’s presence with our Professional Institutional Keychains. Designed for government bodies, land offices, and corporate entities, these keychains deliver a sharp and formal look using precision UV printing. Whether featuring official logos or motivational branding, our durable acrylic builds ensure a long-lasting professional impression that serves as a practical daily reminder of your institution\'s values.', 4, '2026-04-15 09:09:30', '2026-04-22 04:27:57', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('34c5039d-9ba2-4d2a-a8cd-0791f252a832', 'Acrylic Slide', 8, 13, 0, 0, '[\"Portofolio of Digital Printing_69da0ee6a83bb.png\",\"Portofolio of Digital Printing_69da0ee6aacf7.png\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"White\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'Order your custom acrylic slides from us today, we offer high-quality cutting and premium materials.', 3, '2026-04-11 09:05:42', '2026-04-28 06:26:00', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('3533d806-d053-4bec-b092-12f893df72b3', 'Tumbler with Lid Loop White', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_6811c2f074ac1.webp\",\"Tumbler_6811c2f0759c6.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless\",\"Size\":\"500ml\\/1700ml\\/2000ml\"}', 'Designed for convenience and mobility, this tumbler features a sturdy lid with an integrated loop handle. The white finish provides a clean, professional appearance suitable for branding and promotional campaigns.', 145, '2025-04-12 01:32:55', '2026-05-12 21:12:46', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('36100f92-c736-48dc-b580-5b4aa4683f31', 'Best Sympathy For You', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_68b94abed8607.jpg\",\"Merchandise_68b94abf0f074.jpg\",\"Merchandise_68b94abf0f47f.jpg\",\"Merchandise_68b94abf0f7d8.jpg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Cotton pique \\/ Lacoste (breathable & comfortable)\",\"Color\":\"Bright red with grey trim on the collar\",\"Design\":\"SIMPATI logo printed on the left chest\",\"Size\":\"M,L and XL\"}', 'This custom red polo shirt is designed for promotional or corporate use, featuring a bold and professional look. Made from breathable and durable pique cotton fabric, it offers both comfort and style—perfect for team uniforms, marketing events, or brand merchandise.', 214, '2025-09-04 01:15:59', '2026-05-07 11:34:48', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('3699eeb4-1fa9-40f0-86e6-4b1aaa629c84', 'ASW Group\'s MUG', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_69ddc6e55140f.jpg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Ceramic\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'Enhance your daily coffee ritual while showcasing your brand with our Premium Corporate Mugs. Crafted from high-grade ceramic with a brilliant white glaze, these mugs provide a perfect canvas for high-definition logo printing that is both scratch-resistant and dishwasher safe. A practical and lasting promotional tool that keeps your business at the forefront of every morning meeting.', 3, '2026-04-14 04:47:33', '2026-04-20 10:37:36', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('36bc213d-c405-4ad6-b582-26d4cad30fa9', 'Plaque/Plakat Pertamina', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68522494dba55.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68522494e9d5b.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68522494ea7f9.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Size\":\"Custom\"}', 'Premium clear acrylic plaque with elegant and modern design, given by Pertamina Gas Negara as a form of appreciation for its partners. This plaque has a unique shape resembling wings or flames that symbolize passion and innovation. The Pertamina colored logo at the top provides a strong corporate identity.', 289, '2025-06-17 19:29:41', '2026-05-11 17:48:33', 0, 'Aktif', '2026-04-27 07:08:02'),
('36cd6b69-bc7a-4392-8808-7271cf273872', 'Roll Banner Adam Malik Hospital', 8, 13, 0, 0, '[\"Digital Printing_685a5dc4b1d48.webp\",\"Digital Printing_685a5dc4b584a.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Korea Matte \\/ Albatros\",\"Size\":\"60 x 160 cm\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'This banner is made with high quality, designed for long-term indoor use in public areas such as hospitals, health centers, or social activities. The quality of the material and printing supports a professional appearance and strong durability against repeated use. Equipped with a sturdy yet lightweight roll-up aluminum frame, easy to install and carry to various locations without the risk of being easily damaged.', 394, '2025-06-24 01:11:48', '2026-05-11 01:06:44', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('36d0b533-cb2d-4db6-81f6-92e8ed74e2ab', 'Indigo Tumbler', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_6811c08ebf103.webp\",\"Tumbler_6811c08ebf652.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless\",\"Size\":\"500ml\",\"Text\":\"Custom\"}', 'A stylish tumbler with a distinctive indigo tone. Its insulated structure ensures optimal temperature control while offering a unique and eye-catching appearance.', 274, '2025-04-12 01:50:03', '2026-05-08 05:22:26', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('36e12af6-ec77-4dda-bbda-9f9830287683', 'Perintis & Penatua MUG', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_69e84ccb36547.png\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Ceramic\",\"Color\":\"White\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'Preserve your most cherished memories with our High-Definition Photo Mugs. Perfect for religious gatherings, family reunions, or community milestones, our mugs feature a multi-photo collage design that captures the spirit of every occasion. Using premium sublimation printing, we ensure every face and detail is rendered with stunning clarity, creating a heartwarming gift that people will treasure with every morning cup.', 5, '2026-04-15 04:29:17', '2026-05-04 04:08:14', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('37bf4619-cb06-4811-b77d-134814ad38d4', 'Lazada Club Plaque', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_69dc9a9866f69.jpeg\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_69dc9a986838f.jpeg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Purple, Clear\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'Exclusively crafted for elite recognition. This high-grade acrylic plaque combines durable construction with a sophisticated aesthetic, featuring rich color gradients and a premium velvet presentation box. It is a timeless symbol of gratitude and a powerful motivator for continued excellence in any competitive field.', 18, '2026-04-13 07:26:16', '2026-05-11 04:51:42', 1, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('38b28b8c-3b36-496c-8499-63590dc1db8c', 'Acrylic Hampers Box', 9, 4, 0, 0, '[\"Acrylic_6811ab1733d55.webp\",\"Acrylic_68142c6158a70.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Size\":\"Custom\",\"Color\":\"Custom\"}', 'Made with an elegant and transparent design, allowing the recipient to clearly see the contents of the gift.', 357, '2025-04-14 20:51:28', '2026-05-01 23:47:06', 0, 'Aktif', '2026-04-24 08:46:30'),
('3936aa74-0327-46c2-8237-c58c793a72c0', 'King Tumbler', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_6811bf52e2be7.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless\",\"Size\":\"500ml\\/1700ml\\/2000ml\"}', 'A large-capacity tumbler designed for those who need extended hydration. Durable and well-insulated, it’s perfect for long workdays, outdoor events, or promotional campaigns.', 377, '2025-04-15 00:22:19', '2026-05-03 02:50:55', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('39389732-2185-4d84-850b-2e10547c7617', 'Plaque for HIPMI BPC', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df7524ec7a9.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df7524ed342.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18cm\"}', 'This highly distinctive acrylic plaque serves as a formal token of Gratitude and Thanks for attendance and support. The unique design features an oversized graphic of two hands cradling a stylized award trophy, representing support and recognition for the Himpunan Pengusaha Muda Indonesia (HIPMI) Medan. The accompanying text acknowledges the recipient\'s presence and support for the Inauguration of the BPC HIPMI Medan (2020-2023 Period). The plaque\'s graphic is rendered in full color, while the base text panel utilizes a classic, textured background. This impressive keepsake is beautifully presented within a luxurious dark blue and red velvet/satin box, making it an exclusive item for major organizational events.', 93, '2025-10-03 00:03:00', '2026-04-20 07:13:11', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('39959d5c-8e2b-4e5b-875b-b9c60b5631c4', 'Custom Acrylic Appreciation', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df5989ec039.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df598a08f18.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18cm\"}', '\"This elegant acrylic plaque is a token of appreciation and remembrance, presented by Universitas Prima Indonesia – Faculty of Economics to the Office of State Assets and Auction, Kisaran. Designed with a transparent body and dual-logo accents, it symbolizes gratitude and collaboration. Its premium craftsmanship with clear engraving and color printing makes it a meaningful keepsake for institutional recognition. The plaque is beautifully presented in a luxurious red velvet box for an exclusive and professional look.\"', 156, '2025-10-02 22:05:14', '2026-04-07 21:42:39', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('39bca92f-bc8e-4737-9617-a7e493310a3e', 'Sport Tumbler Mountain', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_69d9cf1040905.jpeg\",\"Tumbler_69d9cf10413a2.jpeg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless Steel\",\"Color\":\"White, Red, Blue\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'A sports tumbler is a practical and stylish drink container designed for active lifestyles. Made from durable materials, it helps keep beverages at the desired temperature while being easy to carry during workouts, travel, or daily activities. Perfect for staying hydrated on the go.', 5, '2026-04-11 04:33:20', '2026-04-30 08:58:15', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('3afaa612-0f33-4510-8eb9-3e8e8351211a', 'White Coffee Thermos Tumbler', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_68e0df904ee48.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless\",\"Design\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"500ml\"}', 'This tumbler is processed using a high-quality engraving machine or advanced UV laser printing technology to ensure crisp details, smooth finishing, and long-lasting durability. The design is applied with precision, resulting in a clean and professional look that resists fading and everyday wear. Ideal for personalized gifts, corporate branding, or promotional use, it delivers premium quality at an affordable price.', 120, '2025-10-04 01:49:20', '2026-04-29 12:29:33', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('3b306fa0-7f5c-4073-a97e-c8e1728321a6', 'Black Bowling Tumbler KADIN', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_68e0cbbf061b8.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless Steel\",\"Design\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"750ml\"}', 'This tumbler is crafted using a high-quality engraving machine or advanced UV laser printing technology to deliver sharp, detailed, and long-lasting designs. The professional processing ensures a clean finish that is resistant to fading and daily wear. With premium production standards offered at an affordable price, it is an ideal option for personalized gifts, corporate branding, or promotional purposes.', 88, '2025-10-04 00:24:47', '2026-04-30 03:16:50', 1, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('3c0acb87-684d-43e9-9b03-b61dd2237297', 'RSU Mitra Sejati Event Desk', 8, 13, 0, 0, '[\"Portofolio of Digital Printing_69ddfb1955753.png\"]', '{\"Color\":\"Blue\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'Maximize your promotional presence with our custom-branded Promotion Booth. With a large wrap-around surface and a high-visibility header board, this desk offers a 360-degree branding opportunity to capture attention from every angle. Perfect for institutions such as hospitals, banks, and universities looking for a professional and reliable way to engage with the community.', 3, '2026-04-14 08:30:17', '2026-04-25 05:32:28', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('3c9ae8e3-591c-4f38-9db1-b4722817dc99', 'Engraved Leather', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_6811ac1035649.webp\",\"Merchandise_6811ac1036b4c.webp\"]', '{\"Design\":\"Customizable\",\"Material\":\"Leather\"}', 'Create engravings on your leather products. Using our “Laser Machine” Technology, make your leather products more artistic and exclusive.', 307, '2025-04-14 21:43:51', '2026-05-01 23:47:27', 0, 'Aktif', '2026-04-28 06:52:50'),
('3ca8748e-a45b-48e6-be4f-ec7ec3db7139', 'Mandiri 7 Power Rangers', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df51e4405a3.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df51e4426ea.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Octagonal Shaped Design\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18cm\"}', '\"This exclusive acrylic plaque was created to commemorate the \'7 Power Rangers of Region I / Sumatera 1\' achievement by Mandiri. Featuring a modern octagonal design with a full-color printed display of the Mandiri building, it symbolizes excellence, teamwork, and recognition. Perfectly presented in a premium velvet case, this plaque is ideal for corporate awards, competitions, and institutional milestones.\"', 115, '2025-10-02 21:32:36', '2026-04-13 06:59:35', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('3ca8e8c3-dd5a-49c0-9f94-e1a5c7337c42', 'Calligraphy Table Decor', 9, 12, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Acrylic_693bdcfdc26a5.png\",\"Portfolio of Acrylic_693bdcfdc2e0f.png\",\"Portfolio of Acrylic_693bdcfdc3157.png\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Gold, Black, White\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'A beautifully crafted Islamic table decor featuring the elegant “Bismillah” calligraphy, designed to enhance any room with a spiritual and artistic touch. This layered acrylic piece brings a modern aesthetic while maintaining traditional calligraphy style, making it perfect for home interiors, office desks, gifts, or display decorations. Its striking contrast and polished finish create a premium look that stands out in any setting.', 236, '2025-12-12 02:14:37', '2026-05-04 07:38:05', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('3cceeb44-942c-41fb-8e3f-12288a316d0b', 'BTN Syariah Wall Clock', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_69da14485453c.png\"]', '[]', 'A modern and elegant wall clock designed with a clean minimalist look, perfect for offices, homes, or promotional merchandise. Featuring the BTN Syariah logo at the center, this clock combines practicality and branding in one stylish piece. The clear hour markers and smooth sweeping second hand ensure easy time reading and reliable daily use.', 14, '2026-04-08 03:26:12', '2026-05-12 07:46:13', 3, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('3cd739c7-45c8-44cf-84d9-b174ca928d53', 'Engraved Jeans', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_6811abc497bca.webp\"]', '{\"Design\":\"Customizable\"}', 'Create your own style. We help you realize your dream style by engraving the pants as your preferences.', 296, '2025-04-14 21:53:47', '2026-05-07 00:48:07', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('3cf0ebea-b04e-4603-a478-4098a43d571d', 'Plaque/Plakat GenBI Award', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_683920d114770.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_683920d130a08.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_683920d1318b0.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Thickness\":\"5mm\"}', 'Crafted with a dynamic blue swirl pattern accented by orange dots, the plaque is presented in a royal blue velvet box, symbolizing prestige and gratitude.', 253, '2025-05-29 20:06:57', '2026-05-12 10:45:25', 0, 'Aktif', '2026-04-27 07:11:09'),
('3d7cccec-8cd3-4ec1-bfa8-2feb24ae4f23', 'Plaque PTPN 4', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_6a02e2364fc80.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_6a02e23662ac2.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'Celebrate achievements in the field of natural sciences and sustainability with an award that mirrors the beauty of the earth. This bespoke acrylic plaque features a unique, flowing green crescent design, specifically crafted to honor the Faculty of Agriculture and its distinguished contributors.', 0, '2026-05-12 08:17:58', '2026-05-12 08:17:58', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
