('474cdc1a-f528-4e7b-b064-c832a90bc06a', 'AGRA Xplore Alam Siosar', 8, 13, 0, 0, '[\"Portofolio of Digital Printing_68b94db87c441.jpg\",\"Portofolio of Digital Printing_68b94db87f1c6.jpg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"75 gsm Spunbond non-woven fabric\",\"Color\":\"Black\",\"Type\":\"Spunbond Goodie Bag \\/ Tote Bag\"}', 'This eco-friendly spunbond tote bag is a lightweight and reusable solution, perfect for community events, outdoor activities, or promotional giveaways. It features a bold, adventure-themed design with the \"AGRA Xplore Alam Siosar\" logo, accompanied by mountain graphics and a compass motif, symbolizing exploration and nature.', 185, '2025-09-04 01:28:40', '2026-05-06 04:35:21', 2, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
