('47a47938-0487-4e61-a6ac-80f1fbc7e5c2', 'Plaque/Plakat EDUTAX AWARD', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_6819d8ac5bd0f.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Thickness\":\"8 mm\"}', 'A stylish and modern acrylic award featuring vibrant illustrations and precise print detailing, the design reflects creativity and educational impact, making it a perfect token of appreciation for outstanding contributions to public awareness.', 229, '2025-05-06 02:38:52', '2026-04-17 09:48:19', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
