('47bded57-f512-4662-9dfe-69ae7b1170f5', 'Inclusive Festival Medals', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_69df59af747ba.png\"]', '{\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'Celebrate every achievement with our Custom Commemorative Acrylic Medals. Designed to honor active participation and dedication, these medals feature vibrant, full-color printing that brings your event\'s theme to life. As seen in our collaboration for the \"Inclusive Festival,\" we provide high-quality recognition awards that foster a sense of pride and belonging for every recipient, making them the perfect choice for community festivals, school sports, and corporate achievements.', 2, '2026-04-15 09:26:07', '2026-05-04 04:07:34', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
