('49739157-696b-46a5-9850-fa1cedbf74fc', 'Golf Tournament  Plaque', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df72577b91b.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Colour\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Circular-Shaped Design\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18 cm\"}', 'A stylish acrylic plaque designed for golf tournaments and appreciation awards. The trophy features a golfer silhouette in a circular design, combined with engraved and printed details to honor contributions and achievements. Ideal for tournaments, corporate events, or special recognition ceremonies.', 145, '2025-10-02 23:51:03', '2026-04-17 08:42:39', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
