('4adce51c-2aeb-4ffb-8a79-d04ece6371f4', 'Matte Blue BT Tumbler', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_68e0de46e2a8f.jpg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless\",\"Text\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"500ml\"}', 'This tumbler is professionally processed using a high-quality engraving machine or advanced UV laser printing technology to ensure sharp, precise, and long-lasting results. The design is applied with excellent detail and durability, making it resistant to fading and everyday use. Combining premium production quality with an affordable price, it is a perfect choice for customized gifts, corporate branding, and promotional merchandise.', 155, '2025-10-04 01:43:50', '2026-04-06 07:04:17', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
