('4be5d410-0082-49a5-ad48-235fa1b8bbe5', 'Grand Mercure Paper Bag', 8, 13, 0, 0, '[\"Portofolio of Digital Printing_69df0c13e6c59.jpeg\"]', '{\"Color\":\"Black\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'A statement of class for every gift. Our executive paper bags offer a clean, modern aesthetic with a premium tactile feel. Designed for organizations that settle for nothing less than excellence, these bags provide a dignified way to carry your brand’s identity through the hands of your most valued partners and guests.', 6, '2026-04-15 03:54:59', '2026-05-07 16:13:07', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
