('4da8c476-7dee-4e8b-a684-af07dd0a4188', 'Ministry of Trade Award Plaque', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_693b97e332f70.png\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18 cm\"}', 'An exclusive plaque made of clear acrylic with a gold and black emblem. Designed in a satin-lined storage box and blue velvet, it offers an elegant touch. It\'s suitable as an official award or as a souvenir for an institution.', 164, '2025-12-11 21:19:47', '2026-05-12 22:02:45', 1, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('4f4e100b-3afc-437a-a8d8-8891331dc89f', 'Plaque/Plakat Skkmigas', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68720426428f9.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Sky Blue\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'This exclusive acrylic plaque was specially designed as a token of appreciation for the speakers at the Health Talk event organized by EMP Gebang Ltd. Made of high-quality acrylic, the plaque boasts an elegant, modern design. The top features the logos of the organizers: SKK Migas, IOG 4.0, and EMP, crisply printed using high-quality printing technology. In the center, a detailed thank you note is displayed to Dr. Michael Lumintang Loe for his contribution as a speaker at this health event. The plaque features graphic illustrations themed around the oil and gas industry, reinforcing the identity of the event and the relevant institutions. All details are neatly printed in a cool, professional blue color combination. The plaque is packaged in a luxurious blue velvet box with a gold-colored metal clasp, adding an exclusive and classy touch. It is suitable as a token of appreciation for speakers, speakers, or guests of honor at seminars, talk shows, or other corporate events.', 361, '2025-07-11 23:43:50', '2026-04-29 22:09:55', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('4fb0dddf-76cf-496e-b9cf-7018907a7c89', 'Spunbond Goodiebag', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_6811c02cdd390.webp\",\"Merchandise_6811c02cde19c.png\",\"Merchandise_6811c02cdebc5.webp\",\"Merchandise_6811c02ceecbd.webp\"]', '{\"Dimensions\":\"30 cm x 20 cm x 10 cm\",\"Color\":\"Custom\",\"Material\":\"Water-resistant fabric\"}', 'Customizable, water-resistant fabric bag available in three types, perfect for carrying essentials with style and durability.', 359, '2025-04-15 00:08:36', '2026-05-04 21:10:04', 1, 'Tidak Aktif', '2026-04-27 09:46:19'),
('4fc1c03e-663c-4c2e-b1bb-e6c91be4fe68', 'RSU Mitra Sejati Goodie Bag', 8, 13, 0, 0, '[\"Portofolio of Digital Printing_69ddb9c5efd10.png\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Spunbond\",\"Color\":\"Black\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'A durable and reusable solution for your promotional needs. Made from eco-friendly spunbond material, these bags are designed to be lightweight yet strong enough for daily use. The vibrant printing ensures your logo stands out, making it an effective mobile branding tool for seminars, health campaigns, and community events.', 6, '2026-04-14 03:51:34', '2026-05-01 11:53:10', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('50042e7f-3c8b-430a-8c19-76baf262c016', 'Sogo 3D Letter', 9, 12, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Acrylic_69e58bfcdd4e6.jpg\",\"Portfolio of Acrylic_69e58bfce3cea.jpg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Design\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"Custom\"}', 'A simple display of bras from Wacoal, with a clean design and comfortable fit for everyday wear.', 2, '2026-04-20 02:14:20', '2026-05-12 15:18:18', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('5016ee00-4c6b-46d4-88fd-a51b50e8b662', 'Plaque/Plakat Univ HKBP', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_685a654cc1d65.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_685a654cc5d6d.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"White\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'This acrylic plaque is a form of official award and souvenir by the Quality Assurance Institute of HKBP Nommensen University Medan. Elegantly designed in a royal blue velvet box, this plaque displays the institution\'s logo clearly with a professional finish.', 304, '2025-06-24 01:43:56', '2026-05-07 04:22:57', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('523eb639-3ece-4a91-8a00-9ff6b67d9248', 'PLN Medan Souvenir', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_69ddf785de919.jpg\"]', '{\"Color\":\"White\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'Elevate your professional relationship with our Executive Corporate Gift Set. This curated collection features high-quality essentials, including a premium thermal tumbler, a professional executive pen, an elegant card holder, and modern TWS earbuds, all customized with precision branding. Perfect for rewarding top performers or welcoming key business partners with a touch of sophistication.', 3, '2026-04-14 08:15:01', '2026-05-10 16:50:00', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('52dd1155-a747-4dc6-8aca-a23fb1e1c145', 'Plaque/Plakat Generasi Andalan', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_685a6749c45ab.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_685a6749c8367.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'This elegant plaque made of clear acrylic is given as a form of appreciation to the resource person for the webinar themed \"Kiat kiat persiapan POLTEKPN 2025\". With a modern look and professional print details, this plaque is packaged in a royal blue velvet box that adds a luxurious and formal impression.', 296, '2025-06-24 01:52:25', '2026-05-13 01:33:29', 1, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('534374a3-12e7-4386-a610-ad95da5ce8c2', 'Voucher Baking Demo', 8, 13, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_69d9ce69978d7.jpeg\",\"Merchandise_69d9ce699d0d6.jpeg\"]', '{\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'A voucher is a practical product that can be used as a form of payment or a gift with a specific value. It is suitable for various needs such as shopping, dining, or other services. Vouchers offer convenience, flexibility, and freedom of choice for the recipient—making them an easy yet meaningful gift option.', 3, '2026-04-11 04:30:33', '2026-04-16 01:16:29', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('53c2ad01-b104-4fa0-b6e5-ed1c8f04d7e1', 'Plaque Berkawan Ponsel Medan', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df51045f958.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df510507f6e.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18cm\"}', '\"This elegant acrylic plaque is designed as a token of appreciation for dedication, loyalty, and teamwork. Featuring a sleek transparent body with vibrant printed details, it commemorates the 5th Anniversary of Berkawan Ponsel Medan. Packaged in a premium velvet-lined presentation box, it is perfect for corporate recognition, milestone celebrations, and employee awards.\"', 88, '2025-10-02 21:28:53', '2026-04-11 10:14:30', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('54404581-f293-41f4-8359-1cd4d2931347', 'Plaque PNM Kabanjahe', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_6a019cfeebef9.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"White\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'Celebrate local identity with a plaque that honors the rich traditions of North Sumatra. This bespoke acrylic plaque features a high-definition illustration of the iconic Siwaluh Jabu (Karo Traditional House), accented by vibrant regional patterns and a sharp, star-inspired silhouette.', 0, '2026-05-11 09:10:23', '2026-05-11 09:10:23', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('547d0974-c8e6-41f7-be0a-df3bdbfe4c9f', 'Black Travel Tumbler', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_68e0ce9f1da31.webp\",\"Tumbler_68e0ce9f1e7d4.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless Steel\",\"Design\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"500ml\"}', 'This tumbler is processed using a high-quality engraving machine or advanced UV laser printing technology to produce sharp, precise, and long-lasting designs. The professional finishing ensures a clean, smooth look that resists fading and daily wear. Combining premium quality with an affordable price, it is an ideal choice for customized gifts, corporate branding, and promotional merchandise.', 127, '2025-10-04 00:37:03', '2026-05-11 05:16:42', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('55329892-2ec5-433e-a123-cfc7ea5729be', 'Mini Mug White', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_6811c0cf71fab.webp\",\"Tumbler_6811c0cf72d75.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless\",\"Size\":\"350ml\\/500ml\"}', 'A stylish white stainless-steel mini mug offering a clean and elegant appearance. Ideal for hot or cold beverages, it’s lightweight, durable, and suitable for custom branding.', 232, '2025-04-12 01:49:14', '2026-05-06 14:21:10', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('55fa051a-a28f-47bb-9adb-a872dfd99c06', 'Pushbutton Tumbler', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_68e0d953b144f.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless Steel\",\"Design\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"750ml\"}', 'This tumbler is expertly processed with a high-quality engraving machine or advanced UV laser printing technology, ensuring precise detailing and a sleek, professional finish. The durable printing method keeps the design sharp and resistant to fading, even with everyday use. Combining premium craftsmanship with an affordable price, it is a perfect solution for customized gifts, corporate branding, and promotional needs.', 140, '2025-10-04 01:22:43', '2026-04-07 18:02:48', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL);
INSERT INTO `products` (`product_id`, `name`, `product_type`, `category_type`, `discount`, `price`, `image_url`, `detail`, `description`, `click_count`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `order_click_count`, `status`, `activated_at`) VALUES
('566a06a7-0ff0-4af9-82c2-a17310e21e46', 'Universitas Medan Area Souvenir', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_69ddf8fadcb4a.png\"]', '{\"Color\":\"White\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'A curated selection of office essentials designed for maximum impact. Our gift sets offer a clean, professional aesthetic with high-quality printing that brings your corporate or academic identity to life. From hydration to organization, provide your partners and alumni with a premium kit that reflects your organization\'s high standards and attention to detail.', 3, '2026-04-14 08:21:14', '2026-04-26 17:20:26', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('5777ee76-24bc-4f1a-8548-a71df8cb4743', 'Qur\'an Sacred Verses', 8, 13, 0, 0, '[\"Portofolio of Digital Printing_69dc757717120.jpeg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Black\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'Transform your space into a gallery of faith with our Masterpiece Acrylic Wall Calligraphy. Using ultra-precise laser-cut technology, every intricate curve and stroke of the sacred script is captured with stunning clarity. This large-scale wall art provides a bold, 3D modern aesthetic that seamlessly blends spiritual tradition with contemporary interior design.', 6, '2026-04-13 04:47:51', '2026-05-09 23:44:20', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('57c15762-1246-4eb1-8995-4979dfd546f7', 'Lili Coffee Tumbler White', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_6811c3c8f13d8.webp\",\"Tumbler_6811c3c92d675.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless\",\"Size\":\"500ml\\/1700ml\\/2000ml\",\"Color\":\"Custom\"}', 'A minimalist coffee tumbler featuring a clean white finish. Designed for comfortable grip and insulation performance, ideal for office use or branded merchandise.', 274, '2025-04-11 23:26:27', '2026-05-08 13:38:26', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('5827e08c-b51f-4f3c-af58-192e509ef19b', 'Plaque/Plakat TEMPLATE 009', 2, 2, 0, 0, '[\"Plaque(Plakat)_6811a79d1e31d.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Thickness\":\"8mm & 5mm\",\"Height\":\"13cm x 18 cm\"}', 'This plaque is an elegantly designed and modern form of appreciation, suitable for giving thanks or mementos in various activities or events. Its simple yet attractive design makes it universally usable by various institutions, organizations, or communities.', 174, '2025-04-10 20:31:08', '2026-04-27 02:25:54', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', '2026-04-27 02:23:54'),
('58532011-2b96-4ba8-a3f7-a9e69ac3a32d', 'Graduation Plaque', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df6c271a8c1.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df6c27442b4.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Octagon Design\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18cm\"}', 'The Premium Octagon Gold Edge Crystal Graduation Plaque is an exclusive and elegant gift to celebrate a significant commencement milestone. Crafted from high-quality K9 crystal, this plaque boasts a diamond-like brilliance and clarity, making it a truly unforgettable keepsake. The striking octagonal shape with a gold-accented border gives it a modern and prestigious look.', 116, '2025-10-02 23:24:39', '2026-04-09 18:30:04', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('58eccc7c-8476-4e49-b18e-ce3a8a624caf', '3D Letters', 9, 4, 0, 0, '[\"Acrylic_6811add95759f.webp\",\"Acrylic_6811add975910.webp\",\"Acrylic_6811add975c5c.webp\"]', '{\"Size\":\"Custom\",\"Text\":\"Custom\"}', 'High-quality three-dimensional lettering made from acrylic or similar materials. Perfect for office signage, storefront branding, or event backdrops, delivering strong visual impact and professional identity.', 280, '2025-04-14 20:22:20', '2026-05-12 01:55:00', 2, 'Tidak Aktif', '2026-04-27 06:55:04'),
('59aff158-ba72-461c-a0c9-a6afa0b706eb', 'Red Sport Tumbler', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_68e0cb4a613ca.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless Steel\",\"Design\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"500ml\"}', 'This tumbler is crafted using a high-quality engraving machine or advanced UV laser printing technology, ensuring sharp, precise, and long-lasting designs. The professional processing creates a clean, durable finish that resists fading and daily wear. With premium customization offered at an affordable price, it delivers excellent value for gifts, corporate branding, and promotional purposes.', 100, '2025-10-04 00:22:50', '2026-05-08 12:25:20', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('59e2f0fc-8cae-4716-a162-912ca0924597', 'Plaque/Plakat Conference USU', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_6819d67de8371.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Thickness\":\"8 mm\"}', 'Designed to stand out, it’s perfect for showcasing on desks, shelves, or reception areas as a symbol of creativity, professionalism, and prestige.', 227, '2025-05-06 02:29:34', '2026-05-12 05:36:31', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('5b015dea-3a98-4edb-b6ac-c66c868eabb0', 'Acrylic Helmet Box', 9, 4, 0, 0, '[\"Acrylic_6811aa8877f6c.webp\",\"Acrylic_6811aa8878495.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Size\":\"Custom\"}', 'A storage container safely storing helmets, protecting it from damage or dust, made from acrylic. The design and size can be customized to meet your needs.', 377, '2025-04-14 20:52:17', '2026-05-12 09:12:56', 1, 'Aktif', '2026-04-24 08:52:11'),
('5b5c36fc-fbea-4f80-ace9-e585ed0788d5', 'Room Sign Custom', 9, 12, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_684fc589d6ae9.webp\",\"Tumbler_684fc589e9835.webp\",\"Tumbler_684fc589ec16f.webp\"]', '{\"Color\":\"Black Glosy\",\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Size\":\"Customize\"}', 'Enhance the professionalism and identity of your workplace with this Hanging Acrylic Name Plate. Made from high-quality solid acrylic material, this sign is ideal for use in work environments such as plantations, field projects, warehouses, or other industrial areas.', 413, '2025-06-12 01:51:30', '2026-05-10 16:28:55', 1, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('5b9b9d31-ceb0-4c46-b6a6-34c11a868e3e', 'Zei  Tumbler', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_6811c1f9acada.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless\",\"Size\":\"500ml\"}', 'A modern tumbler with a streamlined silhouette, designed for comfort and portability. Ideal for hot or cold beverages, making it versatile for daily routines.', 249, '2025-04-28 02:16:49', '2026-05-07 02:58:54', 1, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('5c7f82e6-7157-4ed9-8d36-a4a6755c2762', 'Umbul - Umbul', 8, 3, 0, 0, '[\"Design Digital Printing_69f9b13adbd8f.webp\"]', '[]', 'Umbul-umbul is a vertical banner decoration commonly used for promotions, events, or celebrations. With eye-catching designs and durable materials, it effectively attracts attention and enhances visual identity in various locations.', 11, '2026-04-11 04:17:46', '2026-05-12 07:44:48', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('5dbdc6dc-8251-499b-b104-6550a7f05849', 'Mayor Powerbank', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_6852273c9df57.webp\",\"Merchandise_6852273cbe65d.webp\",\"Merchandise_6852273cbe8c4.webp\"]', '{\"Color\":\"White\",\"Desain\":\"Custom\"}', 'Tampil elegan dan fungsional, power bank ini merupakan produk eksklusif bertanda resmi Walikota Medan. Dibalut dengan desain minimalis berwarna putih, produk ini menampilkan logo Garuda Pancasila yang disesuaikan dengan lambang Kota Medan di bagian depan, serta tulisan \"WALIKOTA MEDAN\" sebagai identitas.  Power bank ini dilengkapi dengan layar digital indikator kapasitas baterai yang menunjukkan level daya pada angka 25, 50, 75, dan 100 persen, memberikan informasi yang jelas tentang sisa daya. Tali samping yang elegan menambah kemudahan saat dibawa bepergian.', 300, '2025-06-17 19:41:01', '2026-05-08 22:23:05', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('5e81745b-8665-4ce1-9100-c4522097dcab', 'Souvenir Award Plaque', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df733bac5ea.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df733bace07.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Colour\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Shield-Shaped Design\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18 cm\"}', 'An elegant acrylic souvenir plaque presented in a premium green gift box. This award features a shield-shaped printed logo, engraved text, and decorative side patterns. Perfect as a token of appreciation, corporate gift, or ceremonial award.', 193, '2025-10-02 23:54:51', '2026-04-17 01:39:19', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('5f55550f-a568-4dcc-a855-71bcffcf8ec5', 'Custom Family Photo', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df6dd4ec063.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df6dd50103e.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Colour\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18 cm\"}', 'A unique and elegant family photo plaque made from clear acrylic with custom printing. The plaque features a floral side engraving and a base stand, making it perfect as a personalized gift, home decoration, or family keepsake. The name \"Keluarga Maryadi\" is elegantly displayed on a yellow ribbon banner at the bottom for a personal touch.  Product Details', 203, '2025-10-02 23:31:49', '2026-04-09 18:05:06', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('6180397c-2462-4330-94d4-fe692cf35343', 'Plaque/Plakat TEMPLATE 014', 2, 2, 0, 0, '[\"Plaque(Plakat)_6811a688a154b.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Thickness\":\"8mm & 5mm\",\"Height\":\"13cm x 18 cm\"}', 'This plaque is an elegantly designed and modern form of appreciation, suitable for giving thanks or mementos in various activities or events. Its simple yet attractive design makes it universally usable by various institutions, organizations, or communities.', 233, '2025-04-10 20:33:23', '2026-04-17 08:50:42', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('61e633db-3161-462e-9f53-81c6ef8be410', 'Plain Acrylic Box', 9, 4, 0, 0, '[\"Acrylic_6811a9c988a45.webp\",\"Acrylic_6811a9c994d2f.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Size\":\"Custom\"}', 'A transparent acrylic box designed for display, storage, or event presentation. Its sturdy construction and clear finish make it ideal for showcasing products, documents, or promotional items.', 354, '2025-04-14 20:52:50', '2026-05-12 23:30:45', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('626ee8d7-b9de-4546-8a0e-8bb469c2d3da', 'PT Intan Amanah Plaque', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_693b9a57e0340.png\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Octagonal Design\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18 cm\"}', 'This exclusive octagon-shaped plaque, featuring a combination of clear acrylic and a blue frame, creates a modern and elegant impression. The base features an acrylic stand with a gold label bearing the institution\'s name. This product is ideal for use as an official award for educational institutions, organizations, and companies.', 192, '2025-12-11 21:30:15', '2026-05-07 16:06:52', 2, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('6326f683-56b4-4d6c-b3b9-d0e7865b7a50', 'Lanal TBA Calendar', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_69dc60d636b59.jpeg\",\"Merchandise_69dc60d63d99d.jpeg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Art Carton\",\"Color\":\"Blue\"}', 'With its sleek and precise design, the LANAL TBA Calendar is specially crafted to convey a professional image', 4, '2026-04-13 03:19:50', '2026-05-05 08:36:31', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('64f95213-0412-428f-9532-cf2b5a054b2b', 'Plaque DJPb Field Work', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df774cb4b3c.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Hexagonal Shaped Design\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18cm\"}', 'This unique and aesthetically pleasing acrylic plaque serves as a formal token of Gratitude and Thanks. It is presented to the Regional Office of the Directorate General of Treasury (KANWIL DJPb) of North Sumatra for facilitating a Field Work Practice (PKL) from February 5 to March 8, 2021. The plaque features a striking hexagonal frame outline with elegant floral accents digitally printed onto the clear acrylic, giving it a modern and gentle appearance. It acknowledges a group of students from the Accounting Major, Medan State Polytechnic (Politeknik Negeri Medan). This beautiful keepsake is presented within a luxurious dark blue velvet box, ensuring an exclusive and professional presentation.', 97, '2025-10-03 00:12:12', '2026-04-11 09:19:20', 1, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('650f0006-9d97-45a1-9ce8-2a312480ef81', 'Aptisi Award Plaque', 2, 2, 0, 0, '[\"Design Concept_69ddb4c4b451b.jpeg\",\"Design Concept_69ddb4c4b4bdb.jpeg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\"}', 'Elegant custom acrylic award plaques with a modern curved-top design, featuring vibrant full-color printing and a sturdy clear base. Ideal for academic, corporate, or organizational recognition events, these plaques offer a professional look and can be fully personalized to highlight achievements and branding.', 10, '2026-04-14 03:30:12', '2026-05-10 06:34:17', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('6568b6bf-9886-4aeb-baaf-2c1afed51dfa', 'Plaque/Plakat FK USU', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_681ad6b7819c2.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Thickness\":\"8mm\"}', 'This plaque is specially designed for graduation moments, with high-quality clear acrylic material artistically shaped to resemble a toga hat silhouette and a brain ornament as a symbol of medical science, especially neurosurgery. This plaque carries an elegant and academic impression with detailed laser engraving and the institution\'s logo at the bottom, adding exclusive value and pride.', 310, '2025-05-06 20:42:47', '2026-04-17 00:36:24', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('65ffd88a-4c40-4330-8ab6-681cfa2663ec', 'Commemorative Plaque', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68e5eab76a4a5.jpg\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68e5eab7aca68.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18cm\"}', 'This is a custom acrylic commemorative plaque or trophy presented in a luxurious, hinged, velvet-lined presentation box (likely deep blue or royal blue). It appears to be a formal token of appreciation or recognition, specifically from a student organization in an Indonesian school.', 236, '2025-10-07 21:38:16', '2026-05-01 14:24:52', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
