('7369914e-e65b-44cf-abe3-e8f54797d701', 'Souvenir YONARHANUD 11/WBY', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df7cc86dbe1.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df7cc86e63f.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Colour\":\"Blue\",\"Design\":\"Emblem of YONARHANUD 11\\/WBY with \\u201cWira Bhuana Yudha\\u201d motto, dual pen holders, engraved nameplate\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18 cm\"}', 'This exclusive military desk nameplate is a premium souvenir designed with an elegant blue velvet box, dual golden pen holders, and the official YONARHANUD 11/WBY emblem. Perfect as a collectible, office decoration, or an appreciation gift for military members and partners. The design reflects prestige and honor, making it suitable for display on desks, offices, or as a memorable keepsake.', 122, '2025-10-03 00:35:36', '2026-05-09 16:22:06', 1, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
