('8458973d-7d6e-46dd-a6c4-12e821baa28a', 'Plaque/Plakat LP31', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_681ace88f4016.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"acrylic\",\"Thickness\":\"10mm\"}', 'This exclusive custom-shaped acrylic plaque is made of high-quality clear acrylic material that is sturdy, durable, and has maximum clarity. Suitable for partner appreciation, institutional awards, or official souvenirs, this plaque is equipped with a solid red base that adds a luxurious and stable impression when displayed.', 258, '2025-05-06 20:07:53', '2026-04-17 13:28:58', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('847412f2-558d-45c4-bc78-59b4db161bd6', 'Coloring Event Brochure', 8, 13, 0, 0, '[\"Portofolio of Digital Printing_69dc6adc37ee8.jpeg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Art Paper\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'Captivate your audience with high-impact brochures that deliver your message clearly and effectively. Our premium printing process ensures vibrant colors and sharp text, making it the perfect choice for event announcements, product promotions, or educational materials that demand attention.', 3, '2026-04-13 04:02:36', '2026-04-17 20:00:39', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('84bdde77-74b0-44b6-9ec7-ad88ad5520f9', 'Collaboration Appreciation Trophy', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df5065044da.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df506505ee3.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Colour\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Octagonal Design\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18 cm (width x height)\"}', 'This unique crystal-cut acrylic trophy was created to commemorate the special collaboration between Nongkrong Coffee, Sebyikopi, and Titik Temu. With its elegant multi-faceted design, clear transparent body, and bold printed logos, it serves as a stylish and timeless keepsake to celebrate unity and teamwork. Presented in a premium blue velvet box, it is perfect for events, partnerships, and special recognition.', 144, '2025-10-02 21:26:13', '2026-05-09 00:26:37', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('84dba167-0c49-4e28-b30c-0e4c72445980', 'Plaque  BPN SUMUT JITU', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df79435ffa9.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df7943605bb.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Red\",\"Design\":\"Thumbs-Up Design\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18cm\"}', 'This pair of striking, highly graphic acrylic plaques serves as a motivational award or recognition piece. The design prominently features a large \"Thumbs Up\" hand gesture in bold red and white, symbolizing approval, excellence, and success. The plaques promote the motto \"BPN SUMUT JITU!\" (which translates roughly to \"North Sumatra BPN is Excellent/Accurate!\"). The text includes values such as \"IKHLAS - TUNTAS\" and \"JUJUR - IKHLAS - TUNTAS\", indicating an award for integrity, sincerity, and completion of duties. This unique, energetic keepsake is professionally presented side-by-side within two luxurious red velvet boxes, making them perfect for recognizing high-performing individuals or teams within BPN (National Land Agency) North Sumatra.', 94, '2025-10-03 00:20:35', '2026-04-09 08:20:41', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('8505dece-03c7-4328-b343-740e1926f769', 'ID card & Lanyard', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_6811c0bc91820.webp\",\"Merchandise_6811c0bc91ebf.webp\",\"Merchandise_69e5950473274.jpg\",\"Merchandise_69e5950473d51.jpg\"]', '{\"Dimensions\":\"8.5 cm x 5.5 cm\",\"features\":\"Customizable\",\"Finish\":\"Can be glossy or matte\",\"Material\":\"Durable PVC\"}', 'A complete identification set including a durable ID card and customizable lanyard. Suitable for corporate events, institutions, conferences, and workplace identification needs.', 319, '2025-04-15 00:22:15', '2026-05-12 21:13:30', 1, 'Aktif', '2026-04-28 06:50:23'),
('851b364c-6655-49b5-ae37-7a75b7af9677', 'MBA Men Trophy Plaque', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_693b950571549.png\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_693b950576fae.png\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_693b950578180.png\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Black\",\"Design\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18 cm\"}', 'An exclusive trophy for the Medan Basketball Arena Vol. IV Men\'s KU 13 category. This trophy features the silhouette of a basketball player dunking, combined with the official tournament logo, for a sporty and dynamic feel. It\'s perfect as an official award for both school and club basketball competitions.', 178, '2025-12-11 21:07:33', '2026-05-12 03:25:03', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('872c5273-5f7c-4879-b10b-28747f4e80ff', 'BSN Goodie Bag', 8, 13, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_69dc677860b1f.jpeg\",\"Merchandise_69dc6778688b3.jpeg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Spunbond\",\"Color\":\"White\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'A sustainable and stylish solution for your branding needs. Made from high-quality, eco-friendly spunbond material, this bag offers a professional way to deliver souvenirs and promotional materials while maintaining a clean, premium look.', 3, '2026-04-13 03:48:08', '2026-04-19 00:56:51', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('88540c84-4825-40f3-8c4f-0f5aadf4d53c', 'Plaque BKM Nurul Huda', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_6a0197b4c00b2.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Black, Blue, White\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'Commemorate sacred milestones and official visits with a plaque that reflects spiritual beauty and professional prestige. This custom acrylic award features a high-definition reproduction of a majestic minaret, paired with sophisticated Islamic arch silhouettes.', 3, '2026-05-11 08:47:48', '2026-05-12 03:40:36', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('8a53a7d1-e0ae-4922-ad41-f72946c30057', 'Plaque/Plakat RALLY IND', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_681ac6241027d.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"acrylic\",\"Thickness\":\"8mm\"}', 'This dynamic acrylic award is designed with a modern look that highlights the spirit of competition and achievement in motorsports. With a sharp color print featuring the official \'Rally of Indonesia\' logo and various symbols of supporting institutions, this award reflects the spirit of collaboration and achievement in international events.', 251, '2025-05-06 19:32:04', '2026-05-11 02:03:00', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('8afe7635-1e0d-4d3b-abe5-eec5e1a556f0', 'Red Rubber LED Tumbler', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_68e0d66a84e99.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless Steel\",\"Design\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"500ml\"}', 'This tumbler is processed with a high-quality engraving machine or advanced UV laser printing technology to ensure crisp detailing and a professional finish. The durable printing method keeps the design clear, sharp, and resistant to fading even with daily use. Combining premium customization quality with an affordable price, it offers excellent value for personal gifts, corporate branding, and promotional products.', 87, '2025-10-04 01:10:18', '2026-05-07 21:52:38', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('8b902937-5ea4-4c8b-acca-f058a654a821', 'Wondr\'s MUG', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_69ddc9749bfe7.png\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Ceramic\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'Celebrate the digital era with our Lifestyle Corporate Mug. Designed for the modern professional, this mug features a sleek, high-gloss finish that perfectly showcases vibrant and energetic brand colors. Whether it’s for a tech startup or a digital banking campaign, this mug is the ideal daily companion that blends seamlessly into a dynamic and fast-paced lifestyle.', 15, '2026-04-14 04:58:28', '2026-04-19 20:38:30', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('8dfec54e-b546-4dee-8784-d299f87fa5ea', 'Plaque/Plakat TEMPLATE 017', 2, 2, 0, 0, '[\"Plaque(Plakat)_6811a7251ae4e.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Thickness\":\"8mm & 5mm\",\"Height\":\"13cm x 18 cm\"}', 'This plaque is an elegantly designed and modern form of appreciation, suitable for giving thanks or mementos in various activities or events. Its simple yet attractive design makes it universally usable by various institutions, organizations, or communities.', 132, '2025-04-10 20:32:34', '2026-04-13 05:19:01', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('8f7fd9c5-a47f-4e9a-9c23-0ee566fe2e9f', 'Commemorative Acrylic Plaque', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df58297aecf.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df58297d6ed.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18cm\"}', '\"This exclusive commemorative plaque is a token of appreciation from the Student Association of Islamic Finance & Banking, Politeknik Negeri Medan. Crafted from premium clear acrylic with a dual-logo design, it represents gratitude and recognition towards contributors and partners. The sleek transparent finish, combined with printed institutional logos and elegant typography, makes it a memorable symbol of honor and collaboration. Presented in a premium blue velvet box, this plaque is perfect for academic and organizational awards.\"', 220, '2025-10-02 21:59:21', '2026-04-08 06:02:03', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('8fadccfb-c7cd-4b3f-9187-847ca28ef0fa', 'Travel Size Tumbler', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_6811c1189e2bf.webp\",\"Tumbler_6811c1189f5cf.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless\",\"Size\":\"350ml\\/500ml\"}', 'A compact tumbler made specifically for portability. Its lightweight design fits easily into bags or cup holders, making it ideal for travel, commuting, and quick errands.', 299, '2025-04-15 00:48:36', '2026-04-17 02:14:55', 1, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('92808ba8-5098-4bf0-9f60-57e3e0923f41', 'Sport Ring Tumbler Black', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_6811c39adfd1c.webp\",\"Tumbler_6811c39ae5f00.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless\",\"Size\":\"500ml\"}', 'Designed with a convenient ring handle for easy carrying, this tumbler combines functionality with a sporty aesthetic. Ideal for outdoor events, gyms, and travel use.', 278, '2025-04-12 01:41:00', '2026-05-02 18:25:21', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('92974c00-625d-46eb-939d-6f35f4b6777a', 'Mini Mug Black', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_6811c48a08965.webp\",\"Tumbler_6811c48a20328.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless\",\"Size\":\"350ml\\/500ml\"}', 'A compact and practical black mini mug made from durable stainless steel. Designed for everyday use, it’s perfect for coffee, tea, or your favorite beverages at home, in the office, or on the go. Available in 350 ml and 500 ml capacities to suit your needs, combining functionality with a sleek, modern look.', 318, '2025-04-11 23:46:17', '2026-04-12 22:44:48', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('931b8c00-acf0-4b53-b938-3025db10f619', 'MUG With Custom Print', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_685a72fac884f.webp\",\"Merchandise_685a72facbb78.webp\",\"Merchandise_685a72facbd97.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Ceramic\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'This custom MUG is a product that has been printed with a design using high-quality sublimation techniques. Suitable for personal gifts, company merchandise, event souvenirs, or branding your business. The sharp and durable full color design makes this MUG not only functional, but also full of aesthetic value and identity.', 429, '2025-06-24 01:25:09', '2026-05-08 07:48:01', 1, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('93263d64-e1f1-4c39-967e-ff7c80869f14', 'Plaque Pengadilan Negeri Binjai', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68e087436a8b9.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68e087436d84e.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Colour\":\"Blue\",\"Design\":\"Rectangular-Shaped\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18 cm\"}', 'This modern crystal appreciation plaque is crafted in a rectangular shape with a unique rounded edge, symbolizing professionalism and prestige. It features full-color custom printing and gold decorative accents, making it perfect for corporate recognition, academic appreciation, or institutional awards. Presented in a luxurious red velvet gift box, this plaque is an elegant token of gratitude and achievement.', 185, '2025-10-03 19:32:35', '2026-04-23 07:37:06', 1, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('941453aa-5d4c-4917-aaee-14e16396e5de', 'Plaque/Plakat HDCI ACEH', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_681ac5983b75f.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Thickness\":\"8mm\"}', 'This trophy features the Harley-Davidson Club Indonesia logo, recognizing the HDCI Aceh chapter. It combines a stylish design with a sleek black base.', 262, '2025-05-06 02:34:45', '2026-04-15 04:03:24', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('95cd0182-edb6-4eab-9ddb-8c436b69bd5a', 'Plaque TK Sri Melati', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_6a019c1800cf6.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_6a019c1831c43.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'Capture cherished memories with a plaque that blends modern geometry with delicate artistry. Designed for heartwarming occasions, this bespoke acrylic plaque features a sophisticated gold hexagonal frame accented by soft, hand-painted style botanical illustrations.', 0, '2026-05-11 09:06:32', '2026-05-11 09:06:32', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('95eff4ee-c54a-4e2b-b889-c78b2462b714', 'KKN Mandiri Appreciation', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df837d0282b.jpg\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df837d030b7.jpg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Blue\",\"Design\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18cm\"}', 'This unique, multi-layered acrylic plaque serves as a formal token of Gratitude and Thanks. It is presented by the Student Community Service (KKN Mandiri) team from Universitas Muhammadiyah Sumatera Utara (UMSU) to Desa Padang Brahrang, acknowledging their cooperation and location for the program in 2020. The design is striking, featuring a bold blue and yellow background applied to a custom-cut shape, which is then overlaid with clear text and the official university and regional logos. This premium keepsake is beautifully displayed within a luxurious dark blue velvet box, ensuring an exclusive and professional presentation suitable for commemorating university-community partnerships.', 179, '2025-10-03 01:04:13', '2026-04-09 05:16:43', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL);
