('9654b72c-31fe-4122-9a18-75e5f896f91b', 'Plaque/Plakat Graduates Of UNPAB', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_681ac52ea7b00.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Thickness\":\"5mm & 3mm\"}', 'Commemorative plaque for graduates, celebrating the achievement of earning a degree.', 188, '2025-05-06 02:25:55', '2026-04-15 12:01:29', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('9678f0ac-5a70-4434-81da-9f0b59c5d61a', 'Mug Reuni emas', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_69e0845bca980.jpg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"ceramic\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'A stylish set of ceramic mugs featuring an elegant blue commemorative design with the text **“Reuni Emas 50 Tahun.”** Crafted with a glossy finish and clean white interior, these mugs make meaningful keepsakes for reunion celebrations, anniversaries, or special milestone events. Perfect as memorable gifts, souvenirs, or everyday drinkware that celebrates lasting friendships and shared memories.', 4, '2026-04-16 06:40:27', '2026-05-04 15:12:10', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('96b6e99d-c780-4302-995b-05452492e5ca', 'Black Travel Tumbler Couple Edition', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_68e0d0896b6dc.webp\",\"Tumbler_68e0d0896df1c.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless Steel\",\"Design\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"500ml\"}', 'This tumbler is professionally processed using a high-quality engraving machine or advanced UV laser printing technology, ensuring sharp, detailed, and durable designs. The precise production method delivers a smooth, clean finish that remains resistant to fading and daily use. Offering premium customization at an affordable price, it provides excellent value for personalized gifts, corporate branding, and promotional items.', 100, '2025-10-04 00:45:13', '2026-04-08 18:45:50', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('96f96b35-abf7-4251-8ccf-6c061ab0a677', 'Blue Travel Tumbler Nametag Edition', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_68e0c8c391a34.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless Steel\",\"Design\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"500ml\"}', 'This tumbler is processed with a high-quality engraving machine or advanced UV laser printing technology to ensure sharp, detailed, and long-lasting results. The precise production method creates a clean, professional finish that resists fading and daily wear. Combining premium craftsmanship with an affordable price, it offers outstanding value for personalized gifts, corporate branding, and promotional merchandise.', 136, '2025-10-04 00:12:03', '2026-04-08 15:02:18', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('97c0e5b9-1427-447d-99e5-44542a2cda27', 'INKINDO Flower Board', 8, 13, 0, 0, '[\"Portofolio of Digital Printing_69dc71741f609.jpeg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'Combine respect with modern design. Our Customizable Acrylic Condolence Board features a sturdy metal stand, beautiful faux-flower accents, and a clear, high-quality acrylic panel for personalized messages and logos. Perfect for expressing professional corporate appreciating.', 6, '2026-04-13 04:30:44', '2026-05-07 15:13:40', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('98a4dbe7-ae1e-4718-bf1e-c558b78209b2', 'Plaque for PKM', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df7184d59f2.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df7184d602f.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18cm\"}', 'This elegant, custom-shaped acrylic plaque serves as a formal token of Gratitude and Thanks. It is presented by the students of STIE Pembangunan Nasional Gunung Sitoli to the Head of the Binaka Airport Unit (UPBU Binaka) in Gunung Sitoli, under the Directorate General of Civil Aviation, Ministry of Transportation. The plaque acknowledges the permission and opportunity to conduct Student Field Work Practice (PKM). Designed with a unique clear body and both institutional logos, it lists the participating students\' names. This premium keepsake is beautifully displayed within a luxurious red velvet box, providing an exclusive and professional presentation.', 190, '2025-10-02 23:47:32', '2026-05-06 20:54:06', 1, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('990a6b4d-f9ef-4086-a73c-0a6c0a989521', 'Plaque/Plakat KIP ACEH', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_681acf883f468.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Thickness\":\"5 mm\"}', 'With a sharp, modern design and official emblem, it\'s ideal for recognizing achievements in government, civic duty, or leadership roles.', 137, '2025-05-06 20:12:08', '2026-04-16 00:27:46', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('9b1ec1cd-335a-4ef5-b257-02c0a6d0bddc', 'X-Banner Kemenkes', 8, 13, 0, 0, '[\"Portofolio of Digital Printing_69e04ba6a3377.jpg\",\"Portofolio of Digital Printing_69e04ba6a3c31.jpg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Korea Matte \\/ Albatros\",\"Size\":\"60 x 160 cm\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'An informative and visually engaging X-banner designed to promote the benefits of blood donation. Featuring clean graphics and a clear layout, it highlights key advantages such as improved health, calorie burning, and early disease detection. Ideal for hospitals, health campaigns, or public awareness events, this banner effectively encourages people to donate blood and support a healthier community.', 2, '2026-04-16 02:38:30', '2026-04-20 06:40:21', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('9c0daa3f-3c53-49c5-82b8-2251ba5034b9', 'Shell-ter Tumbler White', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_6811c1431debb.webp\",\"Tumbler_6811c1431eea4.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless\",\"Size\":\"350ml\"}', 'Egg-cellent every day.', 265, '2025-04-15 00:39:11', '2026-04-18 04:35:08', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('9d488801-a93c-4107-a337-4201e4c98db7', 'Plaque/Plakat TEMPLATE 003', 2, 2, 0, 0, '[\"Plaque(Plakat)_6811a5e1aeb42.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Thickness\":\"8mm & 5mm\",\"Height\":\"13cm x 18 cm\"}', 'This plaque is an elegantly designed and modern form of appreciation, suitable for giving thanks or mementos in various activities or events. Its simple yet attractive design makes it universally usable by various institutions, organizations, or communities.', 231, '2025-04-10 20:40:25', '2026-04-17 03:44:01', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('9edb1dcf-4b0d-44d5-a3b3-2cbbf42557e8', 'Custom School Reunion', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df70106bfe8.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df70106d471.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Colour\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Rectangular Design\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18 cm\"}', 'A beautifully designed school reunion acrylic plaque made from premium transparent acrylic with a vibrant school logo and decorative side patterns. Perfect as a souvenir for reunions, alumni gatherings, school anniversaries, or appreciation gifts. Comes with a luxury red velvet box for an elegant presentation.', 87, '2025-10-02 23:41:20', '2026-04-11 09:18:29', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('9f4d6236-3b65-4d08-968c-38ab763ac775', 'Red Sport Tumbler Kec. Medan Timur', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_68e0dd976cd08.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless\",\"Design\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"750ml\"}', 'This tumbler is manufactured using a high-quality engraving machine or advanced UV laser printing technology, ensuring crisp details and a flawless, professional finish. The durable printing process helps maintain the clarity of the design, making it resistant to fading and everyday use. Offering premium customization quality at an affordable price, it is a perfect choice for personal gifts, corporate branding, and promotional products.', 146, '2025-10-04 01:40:55', '2026-04-07 15:43:36', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('a0af0998-f43b-4186-9ce6-a409feca159c', 'Sticker Royal Medica', 8, 13, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_69d9e96b15d1a.jpeg\",\"Merchandise_69d9e96b1659c.jpeg\"]', '{\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'High-quality sticker made with durable, waterproof material and vibrant colors that last. Perfect for decorating laptops, tumblers, notebooks, or any smooth surface. Easy to apply and remove without leaving residue', 7, '2026-04-11 06:25:47', '2026-05-13 01:46:37', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('a1d64a24-c3ce-45b8-9c03-cc72335223d6', 'Custom Wedding Souvenir', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df776c10231.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Colour\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Rectangular Design\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18 cm\"}', 'A beautifully designed acrylic plaque to celebrate a wedding day. This plaque features vibrant floral decorations, personalized names, wedding date, and heartfelt messages. It is presented in an elegant green gift box, making it a perfect keepsake for newlyweds or as a memorable wedding gift from friends and family.', 94, '2025-10-03 00:12:44', '2026-04-28 19:45:19', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('a23f9543-1a7a-40a9-8768-b8bf99726ebd', 'Dinas Kesehatan Plaque', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_69da05ac92431.jpeg\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_69da05ac99aaa.jpeg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Octagonal-Shaped Design\"}', 'This plaque is made of premium acrylic, giving it a luxurious and elegant look', 20, '2026-04-11 08:26:20', '2026-05-12 15:43:21', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('a2fa9b7b-c4b3-45fe-b515-b332bd97de5e', 'Detecting Tumbler Black', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_6811c3e41e148.webp\",\"Tumbler_6811c3e41e731.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless\",\"Size\":\"500ml\"}', 'A modern stainless-steel tumbler with a minimalist black finish. Built for durability and daily convenience, it keeps your drinks secure and easy to carry. Suitable for corporate gifts, events, or personal use.', 153, '2025-04-12 01:37:46', '2026-05-03 02:40:34', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('a3407fa0-4749-40c9-8012-653f38003b57', 'Acrylic Animation Keychains', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_69dc69457bd3a.jpeg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'Durable, lightweight, and fully customizable. Our high-grade acrylic keychains feature vivid double-sided printing and a sturdy metal ring, making them a stylish accessory for keys, bags, or gift sets.', 2, '2026-04-13 03:55:49', '2026-04-24 22:21:00', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('a35816d8-0a37-4699-9c2a-3d3242e0f354', 'Event Booth', 8, 3, 0, 0, '[\"Digital Printing_6811aa7d344bc.webp\",\"Digital Printing_6811aa7d34f54.webp\",\"Digital Printing_6811aa7d356bd.webp\"]', '{\"Size\":\"Adjustable\",\"Color\":\"Custom\",\"Material\":\"Custom\"}', 'A complete booth setup designed to support exhibitions, trade shows, and promotional activities. Built with durable materials and customizable branding surfaces, it creates a professional space to engage visitors and showcase products.', 313, '2025-04-14 02:05:05', '2026-05-07 17:49:17', 0, 'Aktif', '2026-04-27 07:05:49'),
