('b85b7918-7404-4cf5-9dc5-46ee635c8ee3', 'Passport Acrylic Box', 9, 12, 0, 0, '[\"Design Concept_69ddb60a99f10.jpeg\",\"Design Concept_69ddb60a9a43f.jpeg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Size\":\"Custom\"}', 'Premium display plaque featuring a mounted passport replica, elegantly encased in a clear acrylic box with a solid base and engraved nameplate. Designed for official recognition and commemorative purposes, this piece offers a sophisticated presentation while protecting its contents—fully customizable to match institutional or corporate branding.', 13, '2026-04-14 03:35:38', '2026-05-12 07:32:39', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('b886c602-d176-42f9-b0ce-a4e1a118f8c1', 'Wall Clock', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_6811a5174e843.webp\"]', '{\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'Bring an exclusive feel to every second with an elegantly designed custom wall clock. It\'s made from high-quality materials and can be customized to your taste-from colors, images, to initials.', 255, '2025-04-28 01:39:38', '2026-05-10 18:23:25', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('b8fe40a3-19d2-431f-aae7-2459bfeab4e5', '3D Letter Clinic Sign', 9, 12, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Acrylic_69e58cd3245fd.jpeg\",\"Portfolio of Acrylic_69e58cd324c6f.jpeg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Size\":\"Custom\"}', 'A clean clinic sign for an ear, nose, and throat specialist, featuring a simple face outline and clear lettering. It shows the doctor’s name and specialty in a neat, professional design', 3, '2026-04-20 02:17:55', '2026-05-12 03:40:43', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('ba01760e-0d3c-4729-833b-6667ab35060d', 'Niagara Tumbler with Black Button', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_68e0d36709cd9.webp\",\"Tumbler_68e0d3670c7a2.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless Steel\",\"Size\":\"750ml\",\"Text\":\"Custom\"}', 'This tumbler is expertly processed using a high-quality engraving machine or advanced UV laser printing technology, delivering crisp, precise, and durable designs. The professional finishing ensures a smooth appearance that resists fading and everyday wear. With premium-quality results offered at an affordable price, it is perfect for customized gifts, corporate branding, and promotional use.', 121, '2025-10-04 00:57:27', '2026-04-13 05:33:46', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('bbd273a8-a9c9-436e-8258-5e81e19de4e2', 'Sport Tumbler With Custom Print', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_6872083cb585b.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless Steel\",\"Design\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"750ml\"}', 'This elegant, modern-designed tumbler is specially designed as a corporate merchandise or souvenir. Made of high-quality stainless steel with a silver finish, it looks luxurious and professional. The body of the tumbler is precisely printed with the company logo and branding, adding exclusivity and enhancing the company\'s image. The black, tightly screwed lid with an ergonomic handle makes it easy to carry anywhere. This tumbler\'s slim shape ensures a comfortable grip, perfect for everyday use at the office, school, or travel. Its ideal capacity for both hot and cold water makes it a perfect choice for promotional gifts, event giveaways, or corporate souvenirs.', 414, '2025-07-12 00:01:17', '2026-04-27 18:39:36', 3, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('bc9df5d8-26f6-49d5-a0c3-c149cfd549ec', 'Internship Award', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df5764575de.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df57645830a.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Colour\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Shield-Shaped Design\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18 cm\"}', 'This elegant acrylic plaque was presented as a token of appreciation to Kelurahan Tangsi, Binjai City for supporting the successful completion of the Field Practice (Kerja Praktik/Internship) Program of UIN Sumatera Utara students. The plaque features a unique shield-like cut-out design with clear acrylic material, detailed printing, and comes in a premium royal blue velvet box for an exclusive presentation.', 106, '2025-10-02 21:56:04', '2026-04-07 13:29:41', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('bcc7ffc8-2004-4a5e-ac86-40f82f56d388', 'Tumbler Led Glossy', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_6811c1213d7fb.webp\",\"Tumbler_6811c1213dd07.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless\",\"Size\":\"500ml\"}', 'A glossy-finish tumbler equipped with an LED temperature display. Combines modern design with smart functionality, allowing users to check beverage temperature instantly.', 220, '2025-04-12 01:48:43', '2026-04-13 21:51:51', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('be3eaf33-07bd-46b2-880b-8a090775bcff', 'Medan Community League 2021', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df51cb24821.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df51cb270e5.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Colour\":\"Red\",\"Design\":\"Rectangular-Shaped Design\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18 cm\"}', 'This stylish acrylic trophy was exclusively designed for the Medan Community League 2021, honoring the \"Player of the Week.\" Featuring a bold red gradient background with the league’s logo and modern typography, it symbolizes excellence and recognition for outstanding performance. Packaged in a premium blue velvet box, this award is perfect for sports achievements and weekly recognition events.', 162, '2025-10-02 21:32:11', '2026-04-09 08:46:26', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('be4f7fef-5c3f-4fec-ae4f-fa27e3f6f7ba', 'Custom 3D Letter', 9, 12, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Acrylic_682ef2e28c82f.webp\",\"Portfolio of Acrylic_682ef2e28d1a9.webp\",\"Portfolio of Acrylic_682ef2e28da22.webp\",\"Portfolio of Acrylic_682ef2e28e6a1.webp\",\"Portfolio of Acrylic_682ef2e28ef11.webp\",\"Portfolio of Acrylic_682ef2e28f75a.webp\",\"Portfolio of Acrylic_682ef2e29047a.webp\",\"Portfolio of Acrylic_682ef2e290d7f.webp\"]', '{\"Dimensions\":\"Customizable\",\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Finish\":\"Glossy\\/Matte\"}', 'Raised 3D Letters: Bold and modern uppercase lettering spelling out \"KAMAR DAGANG DAN INDUSTRI (KADIN) SUMATERA UTARA.\" The letters are crafted from durable materials such as acrylic or PVC foam board with a smooth white finish, offering a clean and professional appearance suitable for both wall and panel installations.  North Sumatra Emblem: A detailed, high-resolution emblem cutout showcasing the official coat of arms of North Sumatra, complete with symbolic elements like golden horses, a traditional ship, and the motto “Tabah, Jujur, Setia” (Resilient, Honest, Loyal). The emblem adds authority and local identity to the signage.', 283, '2025-05-22 02:48:18', '2026-04-22 06:21:17', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('beb95aca-f335-4137-8ab8-fbfc8f6d47f3', 'Acrylic Plaque for PPL', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df781aec638.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df781aed2cc.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Rectangular-Shaped Design\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18cm\"}', 'This elegant, rectangular acrylic plaque serves as a formal token of Gratitude and Thanks. It is presented by the PPL (Field Teaching Practice) Wave V Students from the Faculty of Islamic Studies and Humanities, Panca Budi Development University, to the institution or location that hosted their field work. The plaque features a simple, curved-edge design with the university\'s logo and lists the names of the nine participating students. The text specifically mentions the location as SD Negeri Inpres Kelambir V Kebon. This beautiful keepsake is presented within a luxurious dark blue velvet box, ensuring an exclusive and professional presentation for acknowledging educational partnerships.', 189, '2025-10-03 00:15:38', '2026-04-17 06:03:08', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('bf6ff942-f5b8-4232-bc80-490a5bef8c89', 'Mug RSU Mitra Sejati', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_69e08969669e7.jpg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"ceramic\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'A clean and professional ceramic mug featuring the **Mitra Sejati** logo in a crisp full-color print on a glossy white finish. Designed for both everyday use and brand visibility, this mug is perfect for offices, corporate giveaways, staff appreciation, or promotional events. Its simple elegant style makes it a practical and memorable custom gift for clients, employees, or business partners.', 4, '2026-04-16 07:02:01', '2026-05-11 13:24:37', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('bf7affe1-2290-44f7-bbb3-23e675385aef', 'Room\'s Acrylic Number', 9, 12, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Acrylic_69e05ef74eb22.jpg\",\"Portfolio of Acrylic_69e05ef754873.jpg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Size\":\"Custom\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'This product is an acrylic room number sign designed to identify a specific room, office, or area in a building. Made from durable acrylic material, the sign displays a clear number (“305”) that helps people easily locate rooms or navigate within places such as offices, hotels, hospitals, or educational institutions. Acrylic is commonly used for signage because it is lightweight, durable, and has a clean, modern appearance similar to glass.', 5, '2026-04-16 04:00:55', '2026-04-29 16:59:53', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('bf86854c-e062-4aaa-a57d-3111346c6687', 'Retirement Black Plaque', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_693b9c63477d1.png\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_693b9c634cbd5.png\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_693b9c634cf39.png\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Octagonal Design\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18 cm\"}', 'This exclusive plaque is made of crystal acrylic with elegant black edges and laser-engraved lettering. Designed as a thank-you plaque for employee contributions, it exudes a luxurious and professional feel. It comes in a premium box lined with gray velvet for an even more special look.', 139, '2025-12-11 21:38:59', '2026-05-11 02:09:12', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('bfd0a04a-9788-4448-bd72-02833daacb73', 'Bank Mandiri Acrylic', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df833e3b6b2.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df833e3e41f.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Colour\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18 cm\"}', 'This elegant acrylic plaque is designed for corporate appreciation and recognition, featuring a unique custom-cut design with the Bank Mandiri logo. Made from high-quality transparent acrylic and placed in a luxurious blue velvet box, it is perfect for employee recognition, career milestones, and corporate events. A timeless keepsake to honor dedication and achievements.', 213, '2025-10-03 01:03:10', '2026-05-07 09:23:15', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('bff0ef2c-55ec-4a0a-83b7-ad995bacd8eb', 'Glossy White BT Tumbler', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_68e0deabaf7e5.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless\",\"Design\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"500ml\"}', 'This tumbler is processed using a high-quality engraving machine or advanced UV laser printing technology, ensuring precise, sharp, and durable results. The professional printing method creates a clean finish that resists fading and daily wear. Offering excellent craftsmanship at an affordable price, it is ideal for personalized gifts, corporate merchandise, or promotional items.', 195, '2025-10-04 01:45:31', '2026-04-17 05:45:28', 1, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('c2b333c1-fbbc-4a45-a112-ed9d893d1f4b', 'Plaque/Plakat QiuBall', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68538587dc996.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68538587de39b.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\"}', 'This exclusive plaque is a trophy award for the 9 Ball billiard tournament championship, specially designed as a symbol of achievement and pride for the champions. Made of high-quality acrylic material with an elegant shield-shaped design, this plaque features the iconic 9 billiard ball graphic and a crown as a symbol of victory. This plaque is packed in a green velvet box with a soft interior that adds a luxurious and professional impression. Perfect for sports tournament awards, especially billiards, and can be used as a valuable souvenir by the winners.', 203, '2025-06-18 20:35:36', '2026-05-09 04:51:33', 0, 'Aktif', '2026-04-27 07:16:28'),
('c301c381-9e6d-45f2-8ac5-44c9b0fec625', 'Plaque KKN Desa Makmur', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_6a02e0d70ced0.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'Celebrate the journey of learning and the power of collaboration with a plaque that speaks to success. This bespoke acrylic plaque is the perfect way to honor graduates, project partners, or community supporters who have contributed to educational milestones.', 0, '2026-05-12 08:12:07', '2026-05-12 08:12:07', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('c34c3db5-eec1-4575-a6c9-a7a5504c877e', 'Bank Sumut Pen', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_69e08e4fd2652.jpg\",\"Merchandise_69e08e4fd2f94.jpg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Plastic\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'A sleek collection of custom branded ballpoint pens featuring a clean white barrel with vibrant blue accents and a professionally printed logo. Designed for smooth everyday writing and strong brand visibility, these pens are perfect for offices, seminars, corporate giveaways, schools, or promotional events. A practical and stylish choice for marketing, client gifts, or daily business use.', 2, '2026-04-16 07:22:55', '2026-04-20 13:17:20', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('c3515bd4-ccd5-4a18-8e4a-58cabf388a0d', 'Shell-ter Tumbler Black', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_6811c164623b1.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless\",\"Size\":\"350ml\"}', 'A premium tumbler featuring a sleek black exterior and insulated interior for temperature retention. Its minimalist yet bold design makes it suitable for executive gifts and modern branding.', 211, '2025-04-15 00:37:36', '2026-05-10 13:07:58', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('c3b4dc41-376c-44a8-a4fb-f464276ed2a9', 'Plaque/Plakat PPB Binjai', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68392250d50c3.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68392250e2079.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68392250e2651.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68392250e2cfb.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Clear\"}', 'Celebrate your extraordinary achievement with an elegant, personalized, and meaningful graduation plaque. Made from quality materials, it can be customized with your name, degree, and logo.', 159, '2025-05-29 20:13:21', '2026-05-13 01:46:44', 0, 'Aktif', '2026-04-27 07:19:39'),
('c44e3d61-afe9-4700-8134-85b2b44761df', 'Field Work Appreciation', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df70bfe03b8.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df70bfe0e9f.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Octagonal Design\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18cm\"}', 'This elegant octagonal acrylic plaque serves as a formal token of Gratitude and Thanks. It is presented in recognition of the opportunity and support provided for the Civil Engineering Field Work Practice (PKL) by Teknik Sipil USU (Universitas Sumatera Utara) in 2020 to PT. Hutama Marga Waskita (HMW), specifically regarding the Tebing Tinggi-Pematang Siantar section (Phase I). Designed with faceted, crystal-like edges and a clear body, it features both the university\'s and the company\'s logos. This premium keepsake is beautifully displayed within a luxurious red velvet box, providing an exclusive and highly professional presentation.', 162, '2025-10-02 23:44:15', '2026-05-13 01:20:15', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('c44f1dde-411b-40a2-b9b0-9c39ed77d72c', 'X-Banner', 8, 13, 0, 0, '[\"Digital Printing_6811a85e23f89.webp\",\"Digital Printing_6811a85e24910.webp\"]', '{\"Size\":\"60 x 160 cm\",\"Color\":\"Custom\",\"Material\":\"Korea Matte\\/ Albatros\"}', 'A lightweight and economical banner stand with an X-frame support system. Designed for easy installation and portability, it is suitable for indoor promotional displays and event branding.', 365, '2025-04-14 02:31:48', '2026-04-27 07:01:20', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', '2026-04-27 02:08:11'),
('c507674e-f9bb-48b7-a50d-5cba2cb1aaab', 'Neon Box', 8, 3, 0, 0, '[\"Digital Printing_6811a8e18d1f6.webp\",\"Digital Printing_6811a8e18de09.webp\",\"Digital Printing_6811a8e18ea36.webp\"]', '{\"Size\":\"Custom\",\"Color\":\"Custom\",\"Material\":\"Olo iron, Chinese Vinyl, LED\\/  Neon Lights and Aluminum cover plate\"}', 'An illuminated signage solution designed to enhance brand visibility, especially in low-light environments. Its bright and attractive display makes it suitable for storefronts, events, and commercial spaces.', 342, '2025-04-14 02:27:51', '2026-04-08 19:37:21', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL);
INSERT INTO `products` (`product_id`, `name`, `product_type`, `category_type`, `discount`, `price`, `image_url`, `detail`, `description`, `click_count`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `order_click_count`, `status`, `activated_at`) VALUES
('c5bd1fba-cdfe-4086-85cf-9e013663f2ca', 'Cool Target Tumbler', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_6811c2e0db904.webp\",\"Tumbler_6811c2e0dbe77.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless\",\"Size\":\"500ml\"}', 'A bold and eye-catching tumbler designed to stand out. Ideal for branding campaigns and corporate merchandise.', 294, '2025-04-28 01:50:32', '2026-05-10 07:33:43', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('c5c44efd-cd9b-4e22-b79a-2d028fda48ad', 'Rectangle Keychain', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_69e08d67ba457.jpg\",\"Merchandise_69e08d67bad90.jpg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Design\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"Custom\"}', 'A personalized acrylic photo keychain designed to turn your favorite memories into a stylish everyday keepsake. Featuring a vibrant full-color printed photo inside a durable clear acrylic frame, it’s perfect for carrying special moments wherever you go. Ideal as a thoughtful gift for friends, loved ones, or as a unique personal accessory with sentimental value.', 2, '2026-04-16 07:19:03', '2026-04-29 06:54:29', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('c6971b90-744e-4eaf-8c8b-65ad3b8ff5c0', 'Tumbler Amaris', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_6811c45f6521a.webp\",\"Tumbler_6811c45f70a12.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless\",\"Size\":\"500ml\"}', 'A premium tumbler crafted for comfort and durability. Its ergonomic design ensures easy handling, while the insulated body helps maintain beverage temperature for extended periods.', 280, '2025-04-11 23:28:49', '2026-04-12 08:31:12', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('c697724d-dd21-4217-9156-82c522bb7e3d', 'My Thermo Set', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_6811c21cc676c.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless\",\"Size\":\"500ml\"}', 'A coordinated thermos set designed for practicality and presentation. Ideal as a corporate gift package, it combines functionality with a refined aesthetic suitable for professional branding.', 219, '2025-04-28 02:16:00', '2026-04-17 14:38:31', 1, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('c9574a88-c5ff-4e06-9317-b67846e3d31a', 'White Lock Tumbler (Blue Ring)', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_68e0d8f287a02.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless Steel\",\"Design\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"500ml\"}', 'This tumbler is processed using a high-quality engraving machine or advanced UV laser printing technology to produce sharp, precise, and long-lasting designs. The professional finishing ensures a smooth, clean look that withstands fading and daily use. Offering excellent durability and premium results at an affordable price, it is ideal for personalized gifts, corporate merchandise, and promotional items.', 104, '2025-10-04 01:21:06', '2026-05-07 00:20:50', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('c9ecc7f4-1baa-4509-b398-8aaf4ed9dae8', 'Perumda Tirtanadi Plaque', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_69dc95a984ea8.jpeg\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_69dc95a988311.jpeg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Blue\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'Celebrate professional achievements with a unique touch of heritage. This premium acrylic plaque features a vibrant batik-patterned accent, seamlessly blending traditional Indonesian art with a modern, crystal-clear aesthetic. Housed in a luxurious velvet presentation box, it serves as a prestigious symbol of gratitude and successful collaboration.', 10, '2026-04-13 07:05:13', '2026-05-11 04:45:35', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('cacb70de-c009-45df-96fb-5477bb848186', 'Plaque Hafidz Qur\'an', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_6a019ec3d65ae.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_6a019ec413dc0.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'Honor sacred milestones with a plaque that reflects the beauty of spiritual dedication. This bespoke acrylic plaque features a unique, custom-cut base shaped like a Rehal (Quran stand), symbolizing the foundation of wisdom and lifelong learning.', 0, '2026-05-11 09:17:56', '2026-05-11 09:17:56', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('cb314262-87fb-417a-93fd-1c6a0507fd58', 'White Travel Tumbler', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_68e0ca4f3ce32.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless Steel\",\"Text\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"350ml\"}', 'This tumbler is processed using a high-quality engraving machine or advanced UV laser printing technology to ensure sharp, precise, and long-lasting designs. The professional production process delivers a smooth and durable finish that resists fading and everyday wear. Offering premium customization quality at an affordable price, it is an ideal choice for personalized gifts, corporate branding, and promotional merchandise.', 142, '2025-10-04 00:18:39', '2026-05-09 23:23:40', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('cb6b0227-27bc-48e0-9a7d-ee61ea3d8182', 'Ka\'bah Design Calligraphy', 8, 13, 0, 0, '[\"Portofolio of Digital Printing_69dc7490c064c.jpeg\",\"Portofolio of Digital Printing_69dc7490c12e8.jpeg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Black\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'Elevate your interior with our Premium Acrylic Calligraphy. Combining sacred artistry with modern design, this piece features high-precision laser cutting and a stunning gold-on-black mirror finish. The crystal-clear acrylic base adds a floating effect, making it a sophisticated spiritual centerpiece for any home or office.', 2, '2026-04-13 04:44:00', '2026-05-04 04:19:00', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('cb8bab2c-10a8-4021-9261-e3c2b6f2d657', 'Plaque/Plakat Template 013', 2, 2, 0, 0, '[\"Plaque(Plakat)_6811a6d69a181.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Thickness\":\"8mm & 5mm\",\"Height\":\"13cm x 18 cm\"}', 'This plaque is an elegantly designed and modern form of appreciation, suitable for giving thanks or mementos in various activities or events. Its simple yet attractive design makes it universally usable by various institutions, organizations, or communities.', 194, '2025-04-10 20:33:03', '2026-04-28 06:19:43', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('cc18a524-26dd-4453-8df7-a05493303c9e', 'Student Internship Plaque', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df8212ce5a9.jpg\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df8212cf0ad.jpg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Green\",\"Design\":\"Vertical Rectangular Shaped\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18cm\"}', 'This pair of identical, custom-shaped acrylic plaques serves as a formal token of Gratitude and Commemoration (Kenang-Kenangan). They are presented by a group of University Students to the KPKN (KPKNL/Kantor Pelayanan Kekayaan Negara dan Lelang) Regional Office I Medan, acknowledging the opportunity to conduct a Student Internship Program (Praktik Kerja Lapangan). The design is distinctive, featuring a green background overlay with rounded corners and the institutional logos, making the text stand out. The plaques list the names of the participating students. These premium keepsakes are beautifully displayed within a luxurious dark blue velvet box, ensuring an exclusive and professional presentation suitable for institutional partnerships.', 150, '2025-10-03 00:58:10', '2026-05-08 11:14:43', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('cc7a4ee2-d52d-4618-868a-983b87eb3a64', 'Event Guest Appreciation', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df71fb9d7ab.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df71fb9de32.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Hexagonal Shaped Design\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18cm\"}', 'This elegant, hexagon-shaped acrylic plaque serves as a formal token of Gratitude and Thanks. It is specifically presented to EDY RAHMAYADI, Governor of North Sumatra, for his attendance at the Annual Congress of the North Sumatra Provincial Futsal Association (AFP) on Saturday, January 16, 2021, held at Universitas Dharmawangsa Medan. Designed with a unique clear body and a logo base, it features the AFP signature block. This premium keepsake is beautifully displayed within a luxurious green velvet box, providing an exclusive and highly professional presentation.', 93, '2025-10-02 23:49:31', '2026-05-11 20:11:02', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('cd3a9e42-d40a-420d-8c28-62b1c0ac4c29', 'Umbrella Rainwear  Essentials', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_6811a650a991b.webp\",\"Merchandise_6811a650a9e69.webp\"]', '{\"Types\":\"GOLF UMBRELLA and Foldable UMBRELLA\"}', 'Protect yourself in style with an exclusive custom umbrella. Designs can be customized with your logo, name, or favorite motif-the perfect choice for corporate gifts or premium branding.', 355, '2025-04-28 01:32:24', '2026-05-08 18:23:33', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
