('e21f459f-eb1e-490b-8f23-ba829a472490', 'Black Sport Tumbler', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_68e0cd33cab4e.webp\",\"Tumbler_68e0cd33cf957.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless Steel\",\"Text\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"750ml\"}', 'This tumbler is expertly processed using a high-quality engraving machine or advanced UV laser printing technology to ensure sharp, detailed, and long-lasting designs. The precise finishing provides a smooth and professional appearance that resists fading and everyday wear. Offering premium customization quality at an affordable price, it is an ideal choice for gifts, corporate branding, and promotional merchandise.', 192, '2025-10-04 00:30:59', '2026-04-11 08:19:19', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('e3b74d46-b5d7-46e8-977f-1d48f106a47a', 'Plaque KKN Unimed', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df7c13ed771.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df7c13efb3d.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Curving Top Design\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18cm\"}', 'This elegant, custom-shaped acrylic plaque serves as a formal token of Gratitude and Thanks. It is presented by the students of Universitas Negeri Medan (UNIMED) to Desa Kota Galuh, Perbaungan, Serdang Bedagai Regency, acknowledging their cooperation and support during the Student Community Service (Kuliah Kerja Nyata - KKN) program. The design features the UNIMED official crest and a stylized green and yellow curving graphic which embodies the university\'s branding. This premium keepsake is beautifully displayed within a luxurious dark green velvet box, ensuring an exclusive and professional presentation suitable for commemorating university-community partnerships.', 188, '2025-10-03 00:32:35', '2026-04-18 07:52:19', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('e691bce5-bbaa-4f6f-9acf-6ebe0b748b44', 'Kantor Arsip USU Plaque', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_69da06d213453.jpeg\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_69da06d21429f.jpeg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Water Drop Design\"}', 'This plaque features a water drop design and is made of premium acrylic, making it perfect as a keepsake', 11, '2026-04-11 08:31:14', '2026-05-11 04:52:11', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('e812d34e-0bbb-4abb-a8de-c45c9fb752d2', 'Plaque/Plakat TEMPLATE 019', 2, 2, 0, 0, '[\"Plaque(Plakat)_6811a6610474d.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Thickness\":\"8mm & 5mm\",\"Height\":\"13cm x 18 cm\"}', 'This plaque is an elegantly designed and modern form of appreciation, suitable for giving thanks or mementos in various activities or events. Its simple yet attractive design makes it universally usable by various institutions, organizations, or communities.', 293, '2025-04-10 20:33:49', '2026-05-04 13:14:58', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('e8859bf7-6b06-4490-9a2b-2d0e43a437f2', 'BPN Acrylic Sign', 9, 12, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Acrylic_69e58e6f938eb.jpeg\",\"Portfolio of Acrylic_69e58e6f94122.jpeg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\"}', 'A wall sign with a wood background and bold lettering, showing the department name for ATR/BPN Sumut. It has a clean, formal look with simple lighting that makes the sign stand out.', 3, '2026-04-20 02:24:47', '2026-04-25 03:50:06', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('e8debdb8-e9c0-42ca-bb80-7007a0f580bf', 'Acrylic Display', 9, 4, 0, 0, '[\"Acrylic_6811a5c76b71d.webp\",\"Acrylic_6811a5c76bd1f.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\"}', 'Often used in various purposes, including trade shows, retail stores, promotional events, and more. They can be designed in various shapes and sizes, ranging from product shelves to information plaques', 405, '2025-04-14 20:57:41', '2026-05-12 07:32:01', 0, 'Aktif', '2026-04-24 08:53:07'),
('e8f92643-877d-48a4-b6cc-25cb81ca2e75', 'Grafir Multitool Army Survival Kit', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_685a719e0a4bf.webp\",\"Merchandise_685a719e0db8d.webp\",\"Merchandise_685a719e0de77.webp\",\"Merchandise_685a719e0e0f3.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Aluminium\"}', 'Multitool Army Survival Kit is a military-grade multi-purpose tool designed for survival, outdoor activities, and emergencies. Equipped with various essential tools in one practical package, this kit now comes more special with name/logo/custom text engraving, making it not only functional, but also exclusive and personal.', 334, '2025-06-24 01:18:53', '2026-04-24 08:41:37', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('e90f32a9-27aa-46a0-afce-c83f79fe873e', 'Character Stickers', 8, 13, 0, 0, '[\"Portofolio of Digital Printing_69e09119c617d.jpg\",\"Portofolio of Digital Printing_69e09119c68e5.jpg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Plastic\"}', 'A fun and colorful collection of custom cartoon character stickers featuring beloved animated favorites in vibrant high-quality print. Made with durable material and clean die-cut edges, these stickers are perfect for decorating laptops, notebooks, water bottles, phone cases, or personal accessories. Great for kids, collectors, and cartoon lovers, they add a playful touch to everyday items while showcasing your favorite characters.', 11, '2026-04-16 07:34:49', '2026-05-12 07:46:40', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('e9bcec4f-61bc-4cd8-91d4-006288dc768d', 'Car Branding', 8, 3, 0, 0, '[\"Digital Printing_6811a91c11d02.webp\",\"Digital Printing_6811a91c12a70.webp\"]', '{\"Size\":\"Adjustable\",\"Color\":\"Custom\",\"Material\":\"Sticker\"}', 'Customizable sticker, ideal for promotional displays with an adjustable size.', 405, '2025-04-14 02:21:17', '2026-05-12 08:18:39', 0, 'Aktif', '2026-04-27 02:10:01'),
('e9d786c2-3515-4fe4-abd6-540128905f55', 'Plaque/Plakat TEMPLATE 018', 2, 2, 0, 0, '[\"Plaque(Plakat)_6811a6b003550.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Thickness\":\"8mm & 5mm\",\"Height\":\"13cm x 18 cm\"}', 'This plaque is an elegantly designed and modern form of appreciation, suitable for giving thanks or mementos in various activities or events. Its simple yet attractive design makes it universally usable by various institutions, organizations, or communities.', 139, '2025-04-10 20:33:10', '2026-04-17 14:28:40', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('eb109ef0-0914-49f0-b18c-494829ee7b90', 'Plakat Universitas Nusa Cendana', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68e08205397ab.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68e082054a872.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Colour\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18 cm\"}', 'Celebrate the milestone achievement of a medical graduate with this elegant Doctor’s Oath Ceremony Plaque. Presented in a luxurious red velvet box, this plaque features the iconic Rod of Asclepius symbol, representing the medical profession, along with the official emblem of Universitas Nusa Cendana’s Faculty of Medicine. Perfect as a commemorative gift for newly sworn-in doctors, this plaque honors dedication, perseverance, and service in the field of medicine.', 125, '2025-10-03 19:10:13', '2026-05-06 06:29:53', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('eb621b4b-fd23-4b2d-81da-f12f38a93bde', 'Plaque/Plakat TOKABE', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_681acee30fed5.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Thickness\":\"5 mm\"}', 'Perfect for corporate branding, achievement awards, or company milestones. Stylish, professional, and designed to stand out on any desk or display shelf.', 195, '2025-05-06 20:09:23', '2026-05-05 19:08:44', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('ebb94821-5124-4d61-9489-56569a80ee6d', 'Casual Sport Tumbler Black', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_6811c162489b4.webp\",\"Tumbler_6811c16249023.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless\",\"Size\":\"500ml\"}', 'A sporty and ergonomic tumbler designed for active lifestyles. Featuring a secure lid and durable body, it’s ideal for workouts, commuting, or outdoor activities. The black finish gives it a strong, modern look suitable for branding or event merchandise.', 211, '2025-04-12 01:46:07', '2026-04-14 20:43:25', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('ebf96e59-f0fe-4803-8ed1-15db3b47f595', 'Business Collaboration Award', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df7bbe1234c.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df7bbe1410a.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Colour\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Octagonal Design\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18 cm\"}', 'A premium acrylic plaque designed to commemorate special partnerships and collaborations. The octagonal shape gives it a modern and elegant look, while the front is printed with colorful brand logos and celebration text. Perfect as a souvenir or recognition award for business events, partnerships, or corporate milestones. Packaged in an exclusive royal blue velvet box for a professional finish.', 112, '2025-10-03 00:31:10', '2026-04-18 03:08:18', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('ec4b019e-0e26-4eab-91a9-a61567ef3a27', 'Cera-milk Tumbler', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_6811bf655c3fe.webp\",\"Tumbler_6811bf655c8eb.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless\",\"Size\":\"400ml\"}', 'A smooth-finish tumbler designed for comfortable grip and daily hydration. Its simple and clean design allows for easy customization.', 136, '2025-04-28 01:38:50', '2026-04-15 03:11:38', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('ecdbf666-4b28-459e-ae46-76151e6ec006', 'Portable Backwall', 8, 3, 0, 0, '[\"Digital Printing_6811a96229ef0.webp\",\"Digital Printing_6811a9622a42b.webp\",\"Digital Printing_6811a9622a76f.webp\"]', '{\"Size\":\"Adjustable\",\"Color\":\"Custom\",\"Material\":\"Custom\"}', 'A lightweight and easy-to-install display system designed for exhibitions, seminars, and promotional events. Its sturdy frame structure ensures stability, while the wide printable surface allows for impactful branding and visual communication.', 557, '2025-04-14 02:18:28', '2026-05-05 22:12:21', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('eceaa812-43b4-4142-a88b-b1d374c20b35', 'Lighter', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_6811a570c27ef.webp\"]', '{\"Text\":\"Custom\",\"Color\":\"White & Black\"}', 'Make lighting a fire even more fun! These custom matches can be printed with any design you like-from logos, funny pictures, to cool quotes. Unique, different, and personalized!', 256, '2025-04-28 01:36:02', '2026-05-12 20:47:44', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('eda7e241-c0c0-4618-832a-e37124981bdd', 'Paper Bag With Custom Print', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_68674e8cc5d24.webp\",\"Merchandise_68674e8d07732.webp\"]', '{\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'Made of high quality paper with glossy finishing that gives an elegant and professional impression. Equipped with a strong and comfortable white handle strap.', 309, '2025-07-03 20:46:21', '2026-04-29 05:58:04', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('ee9d1225-efc5-4d97-9988-4a8f62af9574', 'College Keychains', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_69e86938d4a9e.jpeg\",\"Merchandise_69e86975dc0c9.jpeg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Plastic\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'A large batch of custom acrylic logo keychains featuring a clean round design with vibrant full-color branding. Made with durable materials and sturdy metal rings, these keychains are perfect for organizations, schools, events, communities, or promotional campaigns. Ideal as souvenirs, membership gifts, or branding merchandise, they offer a practical way to keep your logo visible every day.', 6, '2026-04-16 08:44:02', '2026-05-10 09:45:16', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('eeb22682-651f-4010-86fa-e3b0753a0750', 'Idol Keychains', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_69ddc8826e405.jpg\",\"Merchandise_69ddc8826ee3e.jpg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'Bring your favorite characters or moments to life with our Custom Acrylic Keychains. Crafted with crystal-clear high-grade acrylic, these keychains feature vibrant, full-color printing that captures every detail and expression perfectly. Whether for gaming communities, fan collectives, or personal gifts, our precision-cut keychains are the ultimate way to carry your passion wherever you go.', 5, '2026-04-14 04:54:26', '2026-04-25 01:56:17', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('ef0e2fa6-736d-4f01-984e-1e56d71d6616', 'Black Victory Sport Tumbler', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_68e0dcdf95701.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless Steel\",\"Text\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"500ml\"}', 'This tumbler is processed using a high-quality engraving machine or advanced UV laser printing technology to ensure sharp, detailed, and long-lasting results. The professional finishing provides a clean and durable design that resists fading and daily wear. With premium production quality offered at an affordable price, it is an excellent choice for personalized gifts, corporate branding, and promotional merchandise.', 214, '2025-10-04 01:37:51', '2026-05-05 14:23:56', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('f009ccce-e9f9-447c-8824-ab7d9f4e8603', 'Roll Banner', 8, 3, 0, 0, '[\"Digital Printing_69d9ecde05ba2.jpeg\",\"Digital Printing_69d9ecde064ed.jpeg\"]', '[]', 'Premium roll-up banner with a sleek and portable design, perfect for promotions, events, and in-store displays. Features high-resolution printing with vibrant colors, ensuring your message stands out clearly and professionally', 2, '2026-04-11 06:40:30', '2026-04-17 12:15:54', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('f04fa76e-eae1-47c8-a4f0-80a77bbffa96', 'Mug Ibekami', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_69e08568597de.jpg\",\"Merchandise_69e0856859f82.jpg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"ceramic\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'A sleek matte black ceramic mug with a modern minimalist look, featuring a finely detailed engraved-style logo on the front. Topped with a natural wooden lid, it offers both style and practicality—helping keep your drinks warm while adding a premium touch. Perfect for coffee, tea, or as a sophisticated personalized gift for any occasion.', 6, '2026-04-16 06:44:56', '2026-05-12 23:42:44', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('f069c141-aabd-4eed-b98e-d8082a291599', 'Coffee Led White', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_6811c3d69adba.webp\",\"Tumbler_6811c3d69c375.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless\",\"Size\":\"350ml\",\"Color\":\"Custom\"}', 'A contemporary tumbler with an LED temperature indicator integrated into the lid. The white finish enhances its sleek design, making it both functional and visually appealing for daily use or promotional purposes.', 423, '2025-04-11 23:43:52', '2026-04-26 11:19:15', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('f07ac167-d19a-4be2-a94b-571038961a3a', 'Plaque/Plakat TEMPLATE 016', 2, 2, 0, 0, '[\"Plaque(Plakat)_6811a76fd8258.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Thickness\":\"8mm & 5mm\",\"Height\":\"13cm x 18 cm\"}', 'This plaque is an elegantly designed and modern form of appreciation, suitable for giving thanks or mementos in various activities or events. Its simple yet attractive design makes it universally usable by various institutions, organizations, or communities.', 182, '2025-04-10 20:31:48', '2026-04-15 11:43:47', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('f1be56c8-324d-4584-a2e6-763b9e0b6096', 'Recognition Plaque', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_68b93fae21aee.webp\",\"Merchandise_68b93faf4db41.webp\",\"Merchandise_68b93faf4de13.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Blue\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'This custom acrylic plaque is the perfect choice for awards, keepsakes, or tokens of appreciation. Made from high-quality acrylic with sharp, vibrant prints, it comes in a luxurious, elegant velvet box.', 153, '2025-09-04 00:28:47', '2026-05-11 01:31:43', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('f1db80cc-1815-43b9-91be-ac71bbc11cff', 'Lanal TBA Key Mockup', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_69da13d5e7748.jpeg\",\"Merchandise_69da13d5e7fc8.jpeg\"]', '{\"Color\":\"Black, Blue\",\"Design\":\"Key-Shaped Design\"}', 'This key mockup is the symbol of the Lanal TBA event to be held in 2026', 6, '2026-04-11 09:26:45', '2026-05-11 14:41:05', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('f1e0018b-52c5-4d36-8aff-f0449781d037', 'BSN Pen', 8, 3, 0, 0, '[\"Digital Printing_69da08d6716b7.jpeg\",\"Digital Printing_69da08d673d8a.jpeg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Plastic\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'High-quality pen designed for smooth and consistent writing, perfect for daily use, office needs, or promotional giveaways. Features a comfortable grip and sleek design, making it both practical and stylish', 5, '2026-04-11 08:39:50', '2026-05-12 03:43:16', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('f22d24f6-82a1-4083-9bc7-e577f5b370bc', 'Festival Mardoton Acrylic Award', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df8156c6404.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df8156c7e89.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Colour\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18 cm\"}', 'This unique acrylic plaque is designed exclusively for events, festivals, and community appreciation programs. Featuring the “Festival Mardoton” theme with a custom printed design of a traditional paddler illustration, it is perfect for honoring speakers, contributors, or special guests. Packaged in a red velvet gift box, this plaque is both a cultural keepsake and a symbol of gratitude.', 128, '2025-10-03 00:55:02', '2026-04-08 13:06:38', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('f247fc81-e023-44f4-96e8-5982b3cb5314', 'Custom Wedding & Celebration', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df806e5b415.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Colour\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18 cm\"}', 'This stylish acrylic plaque is designed for special celebrations such as weddings, anniversaries, or milestone events. Featuring a modern printed design with “52 Sold Out!” and a personalized wedding greeting, it comes in a vibrant yellow velvet gift box. Perfect as a wedding souvenir, anniversary keepsake, or personalized event award to make every moment unforgettable.', 206, '2025-10-03 00:51:10', '2026-05-10 11:08:08', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('f365f1f3-2c89-48af-8413-25a54b4b98a3', 'Tumbler Souvenir Box', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_69df58304f4e0.jpg\"]', '{\"Color\":\"Black, Pink\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'Make your corporate gifts unforgettable with our Luxury Executive Gift Boxes. Designed to house premium items like our thermal tumblers and custom cardholders, these boxes feature a sturdy structured build and elegant interior cushioning. As seen in our specialized sets, we provide a sophisticated presentation that reflects the high value you place on your professional partnerships.', 7, '2026-04-15 09:19:44', '2026-05-11 23:50:37', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('f47918aa-560d-4189-b94e-f7f1b553a8df', 'Plaque STI Certify', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_6a02e17575da2.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'Display your professional credentials with a plaque that reflects clarity, precision, and trust. This bespoke circular acrylic plaque is specifically designed for medical clinics, high-end beauty salons, and technical certification programs to showcase official partnerships and equipment certifications.', 0, '2026-05-12 08:14:45', '2026-05-12 08:14:45', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('f582bd65-3070-4aff-857f-adb8d1c8839e', 'Plaque/Plakat Graduates Of UNPAB', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_681ac71e62ff7.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Thickness\":\"5mm & 3mm\"}', 'A graduation plaque from Universitas Pembangunan Panca Budi, featuring the graduate\'s photo and details about their program.', 245, '2025-05-06 19:36:14', '2026-04-15 10:59:32', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('f5888279-a181-407c-afc1-7f0490b43c0e', 'Graduation Internship', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df7ea571198.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Colour\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Polygon-Shaped Design\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18 cm\"}', 'This elegant appreciation plaque is crafted from high-quality acrylic with a unique polygon edge design and presented in a premium velvet box. It is custom-engraved to commemorate internship programs, graduations, or institutional appreciation events. The clear acrylic and purple accent make it a standout keepsake for companies, universities, and organizations. Perfect as a token of gratitude, achievement award, or memorable corporate gift.', 169, '2025-10-03 00:43:33', '2026-05-12 16:35:32', 1, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL);
INSERT INTO `products` (`product_id`, `name`, `product_type`, `category_type`, `discount`, `price`, `image_url`, `detail`, `description`, `click_count`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `order_click_count`, `status`, `activated_at`) VALUES
('f6206942-2696-4928-ab80-da3a99b45e74', 'Plaque for BIMASURYA', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df7b1ab2c6a.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df7b1ab322f.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Crest-Shaped Design\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18cm\"}', 'This elegant, custom-shaped acrylic plaque serves as a formal token of Gratitude and Thanks. It is presented by a group of students (Maza, Mina, Tari, Ari, Rizal) from UMN Al-Washliyah Medan to the Office of the Village Head of Kota Galuh, specifically acknowledging the support provided for a Student Community Service (BIMASURYA) activity. The design prominently features the university\'s official crest and the village\'s logo. This premium keepsake is beautifully displayed within a luxurious dark blue velvet box, ensuring an exclusive and professional presentation suitable for acknowledging community partnerships.', 83, '2025-10-03 00:28:26', '2026-04-11 08:19:14', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('f708cca4-7ec4-4dcb-aa6c-907666099987', 'Niagara Tumbler with Red Button', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_68e0d4b029549.webp\",\"Tumbler_68e0d4b030529.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless Steel\",\"Text\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"500ml\"}', 'This tumbler is produced using a high-quality engraving machine or advanced UV laser printing technology, ensuring precise details and a smooth, professional finish. The durable printing process keeps the design sharp and resistant to fading, even with regular use. With premium customization quality offered at an affordable price, it provides excellent value for gifts, corporate branding, and promotional needs.', 156, '2025-10-04 01:02:56', '2026-04-30 22:32:03', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('f858ded3-c5ee-48e1-bf7f-79b780c9bb9e', 'Acrylic Name Plate', 9, 4, 0, 0, '[\"Acrylic_6811a94cd4272.webp\",\"Acrylic_6811a94cd47f9.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Size\":\"Custom\",\"Text\":\"Custome\"}', 'It comes in various color options. The shape and text can be customized to meet your needs.', 290, '2025-04-14 20:53:25', '2026-05-11 05:04:36', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('f85f7e43-a347-4c92-8e3c-92a21e25a733', 'Plaque Turnamen Billiard', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_6a019ac947c8a.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_6a019ac9734e8.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'Take your tournament to the next level with our custom-designed Billiard Recognition Plaques. Combining a playful 3D-inspired aesthetic with a sleek, modern silhouette, these plaques are the perfect way to honor precision and skill on the table.', 0, '2026-05-11 09:00:57', '2026-05-11 09:00:57', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('f913159d-5b60-41e9-8aa1-8c93de80c3ce', 'Safety Stickers', 8, 13, 0, 0, '[\"Portofolio of Digital Printing_69e5923385205.jpg\",\"Portofolio of Digital Printing_69e5923385710.jpg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Vinyl\"}', 'A sheet of safety stickers with different symbols for fire, first aid, hazards, and training. Each sticker is clear and easy to understand, making them useful for workplace safety and labeling.', 4, '2026-04-20 02:40:51', '2026-05-06 15:34:13', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('fa1ff1f7-30fb-44e7-81e9-c8de624a1744', 'BT Tumbler', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_6811c1ca6ead0.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless\",\"Size\":\"500ml\"}', 'A compact and practical tumbler designed for everyday convenience. Lightweight yet durable, it’s suitable for branding, corporate merchandise, and personal use.', 337, '2025-04-28 19:00:28', '2026-05-09 17:29:55', 2, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('fb338495-2dde-4e9b-a308-db5a2961f174', 'Care And Reach Acrylic Medal', 9, 12, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Acrylic_687216da3e1b2.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'This medal is specially designed as a symbol of appreciation for the participants of the Inclusive Festival. Made of high-quality acrylic with bright, colorful printing, the medal features illustrations of inclusive characters representing diversity and the spirit of togetherness. The text surrounding the medal reads \"Participatory Award - Inclusive Festival,\" emphasizing the recipients\' active participation in the event. The medal comes with a strong and comfortable blue and white striped lanyard, providing an elegant yet festive look. This medal is perfect for festivals, competitions, workshops, seminars, or community activities that emphasize the values of inclusivity, active participation, and togetherness.', 341, '2025-07-12 01:03:38', '2026-04-28 22:55:39', 1, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('fb516716-3372-41ab-87b0-bfd9635c19c5', 'King Tumbler With Custom Print', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_684fe1f82ecb0.jpeg\",\"Tumbler_684fe1f87bd4c.jpeg\",\"Tumbler_684fe1f87bfb1.jpeg\"]', '{\"Size\":\"1000ml\",\"Material\":\"Stainless\",\"Text\":\"Custom\"}', 'Look more personal with the Pink Custom Tumbler! Made from high-quality materials, this tumbler is specially designed for those of you who want to look different and care more about the environment. With a choice of custom names or designs as desired, this tumbler is perfect as a loyal friend when working, exercising, traveling, or just relaxing.', 208, '2025-06-16 02:20:56', '2026-05-07 13:25:09', 3, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('fc69d9e9-3167-46de-aadc-c7d31a75947d', 'Black Travel Tumbler KILLINEY', 1, 1, 0, 0, '[\"Tumbler_68e0c9acd3eb9.webp\",\"Tumbler_68e0c9acd6739.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Stainless Steel\",\"Text\":\"Custom\",\"Size\":\"500ml\"}', 'This tumbler is expertly processed using a high-quality engraving machine or advanced UV laser printing technology to ensure crisp, detailed, and long-lasting designs. The precise finishing creates a smooth and professional appearance that resists fading and everyday wear. Combining premium craftsmanship with an affordable price, it offers excellent value for personalized gifts, corporate branding, and promotional merchandise.', 118, '2025-10-04 00:15:56', '2026-04-09 06:43:09', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('fcaa4772-ec2c-453a-afb6-596ff34f3403', 'Acrylic Tent for Table', 9, 4, 0, 0, '[\"Acrylic_6811a6559007d.webp\",\"Acrylic_6811a65590532.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Text\":\"Custom\"}', 'Emphasize the appearance of your table. We help you to make it in acrylic form. Stronger and more durable for your needs.', 313, '2025-04-14 20:57:12', '2026-05-01 12:27:17', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('fd0bc9f3-1160-40e3-9a1c-933769d116e3', 'Budi Gadai Plaque', 2, 2, 0, 0, '[\"Design Concept_69da0a51ee94e.jpeg\",\"Design Concept_69da0a51efa23.jpeg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Size\":\"Custom\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'Elegant plaque crafted from high-quality materials, perfect for awards, recognition, or commemorative purposes. Designed with a premium finish and customizable details, making it a meaningful and professional keepsake', 22, '2026-04-11 08:46:09', '2026-05-11 04:52:05', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('fdb8945c-06a2-464f-ac2b-b89e82af5ebd', 'Anugerah Gemilang Pen', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_69e08ffd6b4fc.jpeg\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Plastic\"}', 'A premium set of custom branded ballpoint pens featuring a bold red barrel with white grip detail and crisp logo printing for a professional finish. Built for smooth, reliable writing, these pens are ideal for offices, company promotions, seminars, training events, and client giveaways. Their striking color combination makes them both practical and eye-catching, perfect for everyday use while reinforcing your brand identity.', 8, '2026-04-16 07:30:05', '2026-05-09 18:05:50', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('fe64fd1e-18e3-420e-964e-f0c482a3e62b', 'Professional Organization Event', 2, 11, 0, 0, '[\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df7d040260b.webp\",\"Portfolio of Plaques_68df7d040381d.webp\"]', '{\"Material\":\"Acrylic\",\"Color\":\"Clear\",\"Design\":\"Rectangular Shaped Design\",\"Size\":\"13 x 18cm\"}', 'This elegant, rectangular acrylic plaque serves as a formal token of Gratitude and Thanks. It is presented by PTGMI (Persatuan Terapis Gigi dan Mulut Indonesia) DPC Deli Serdang to Ibu drg. Dewi Rosita, the Head of PDGI (Persatuan Dokter Gigi Indonesia) Deli Serdang Regency. The plaque acknowledges her attendance at the Muscab II PTGMI DPC Deli Serdang on Saturday, August 15, 2020. The design features a classic ornate border in gold/brown and the official PTGMI logo. This premium keepsake is beautifully displayed within a luxurious dark blue velvet box, ensuring an exclusive and professional presentation suitable for inter-professional recognition.', 176, '2025-10-03 00:36:36', '2026-05-04 22:18:38', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL),
('ff79f32b-d5c6-4538-8a1b-9d3ce9463175', 'Tokabe Souvenir Box', 1, 5, 0, 0, '[\"Merchandise_69ddfa0b34efb.png\"]', '{\"Color\":\"Black\",\"Design\":\"Custom\"}', 'Make every gift unforgettable with our Premium Presentation Box. Wrapped in high-quality textured material with a soft-touch finish, this box is designed to provide a prestigious unboxing experience. Whether for an executive plaque or a curated souvenir set, our boxes offer the perfect blend of protection and elegance, ensuring your gift is presented with the respect it deserves.', 2, '2026-04-14 08:25:47', '2026-04-21 16:04:22', 0, 'Tidak Aktif', NULL);
